<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Kings</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Si</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 SIAPHARAN</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Kings</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Samuel</char> ccauh hae kya-e Israel siapharan hae phungpaw kha <char style="bk">Siapharan Uk Kheitnaw</char> kyahin piachih athua. E ccauh hynh phuin thum lang phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Solomon nynh Israel te Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw te a paaw David chinaw kong.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Solomon nynh a uknaw te a ryalawnaw. Abyapihua lante Jerusalem Beikinn a saknaw kong.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Thahlang peenaw te alia peenaw cite a phiakunaw kong te BC 850 cia tuh-e peenaw hae a uktu siapharan hae phungpaw.</para>
  <para style="ip">Siapharan Ccauh uk ning hae kyahin uktu miakaw kha Pachia tungvaw a lungzi tou zi khyh tou cipaw syntawte byapia athua hae. Zohtuh beiknaw te kawngae leinaw nynh ronaw a thuakhae. Thahlang peenaw kya-e siapharan hae tuh tuh-e syntawnaw kya a shung hae. Alia peenaw kya-e Judah siapharan hae tuh abang shung hae zah abang a aw hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Siapharan Uk Kheitnaw</char> kyaze alangkuh hua hae paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh hae ryalawnaw thua zah, tuh-e hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha zohtuh beik lei lan te Pachia kaw-ei lei lan rawthungte raeringnaw pya hae zah a hopya hae. Tuh-e hae kyaze a minthaan huapaw tuh Elijah thua zah Baal profeh hae ryte a taekunaw hae kong kha byaria 18 kya a um.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">David uknaw athangnaw 1.1—2.12</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon tuh siapharan lang a tang 2.13-46</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon uknaw 3.1—11.43</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Atakaw lya-e kum hae 3.1—4.34</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Beikinn saknaw 5.1—8.66</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Nyathya e kum hae 9.1—11.43</para>
  <para style="io1">Peenaw a phia hae 12.1—22.53</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Thahlang e phin hae nynh rhaw a tho hae 12.1—14.20</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Judah te Israel siapharan hae 14.21—16.34</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Profeh Elijah 17.1—19.21</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Israel siapharan Ahab 20.1—22.40</para>
  <para style="io2">e. Judah siapharan Jehoshafat te Israel siapharan Ahaziah 22.41-53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David Siapharan A Taw Vae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siapharan tuh taw vae zah a kum myarya tang vae; boei a thy hae zemah a khualung kho vae khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw elang a kum nopaw liaccady kha kae ccungpah sah, aning nynh nang kha ae umkhae sah lah, ae do-oih sah; siapharan ka bawipaw tuh na khualung ccaw, na by vawlan ih sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel ram pynpi phe lekuh lan apuithyapaw liaccaw kha ccungpah hae zah, Shunam khuanung Abishag kha a muih hae, te siapharan kalan a cciakhae hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Liaccanung tuh myarya puithya; siapharan kha umkhae zah a do-oih, thuasalama siapharan nynh amaw kha ikhae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Haggith ccapaw Adonijah nynh amaw te amaw hangsakuh zah, “Siapharan lang ka tang cih,” ci zah, amaw hanlan marangle hae, marang rhawkaw hae te a malang a ccue lanpaw ccungccaw sung pangaw kha a paccyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:4">2Sa 3.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />A paaw nynh, “Pawccemou hynhte khahte na cyi?” cite mah hohtutuh mah amaw kha a lunghoy lei lante hopah boi khyh. Aning tuh myarya puithya zah, Absalom he a zui lante a puipaw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning tuh Zeruiah ccapaw Joab, ranpibawi Abiathar ryte hobung hae zah, minmin nynh Adonijah kha a pankhae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama ranpibawi Zadok, Johoiada ccapaw Benaiah, profeh Nathan, Shimei, Rei te David rhawviatu rhawkaw hae tuh Adonijah kalan pan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adonijah nynh Enrogel pe umpaw Zoheleth lungpi pe khe tuu hae, tangnuapaw hae te athopaw sahiin hae khate silawnaw rae zah, a uno hae balyn, siapharan ccapaw hae te Judah ram umpaw siapharan kuihkaw e bawi hae balyn kha a ko hae, <verse number="10" style="v" />thuasalama profeh Nathan, Benaiah, rhawviatu rhawkaw hae te a neitaw Solomon kha tuh ko khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Nathan nynh Solomon nung Bathsheba kha, “Haggith ccapaw Adonijah tuh ah bawipaw David ny leite siapharan lang a tang vae cipaw na thae khyh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">2Sa 12.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze yn cceih lah, na hiinnaw te na ccapaw Solomon hiinnaw kha khum khylan tuanaw kae pyatua sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />David siapharan kalan arangte la cceih lah, amaw kha, ‘Siapharan ka bawipaw, nang nynh na seenung kyaze: Na ccapaw Solomon tuh kamaw koute siapharan lang a tang cih zah, ka bawitungkhung kya a haung cih, cite bya nae kinpakuh khyh tou? Pawccemou Adonijah hynh siapharan lang a tang?’ cite la hopah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhcite siapharan kya bya na hopya lyakhe, kae nynh kae teethin cih zah na bya kha kae tynsah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bathsheba nynh siapharan kalan a khaan lungkhu lang a tee. Siapharan tuh myarya taw vae; Shunam khuanung Abishag nynh siapharan kha a do-oih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsheba nynh bakhung zah siapharan kha sawtuanaw a pya, te siapharan nynh, “Pawmou na ry?” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh siapharan kha, “Ka bawipaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia min phyate na seenung hynh bya nae kinpakuh zah: Na ccapaw Solomon tuh kamaw koute siapharan lang a tang cih zah, ka bawitungkhung kya a haung cih, na ci. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan ka bawipaw, atu tuh namaw mah ny leite, Adonijah tuh siapharan lang a tang vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh tangnuapaw hae, athopaw sahiin hae te tuu hae patae khate silawnaw rae zah, siapharan ccapaw hae balyn, ranpibawi Abiathar te rhawkaw hae bawipaw Joab kha a ko hae; thuasalama na seepaw Solomon tuh ko khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Siapharan ka bawipaw, namaw koute siapharan ka bawipaw kya-e bawitungkhung kya hummou a haung cih cipaw kha oun hopah sah cite, Israel hae balyn nynh nang kha ae do hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze tuh siapharan ka bawipaw tuh na minpaaw hae kya he na ihbua te, kae te ka ccapaw Solomon tuh seinaw a raetu hae lang oun ria vae cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhcite siapharan te bya a hoku cciamang lya hae khe, profeh Nathan tuh yn teebua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Siapharan kha, “E kya profeh Nathan a um,” cite a hopya hae. Aning nynh siapharan malang he a tee te, laekhu kya bakhung zah siapharan kha sawtuanaw a pya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Nathan nynh, “Siapharan ka bawipaw, ‘Kamaw koute Adonijah nynh siapharan lang a tang cih zah ka bawitungkhung kya a haung cih,’ cite na ho tou? <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize atunin kya aning nynh cceih zah tangnuapaw hae, athopaw sahiin hae te tuu hae patae khate silawnaw rae zah, siapharan ccapaw hae balyn, rhawkaw hae bawipaw Joab te ranpibawi Abiathar kha a ko hae, minmin tuh amaw malang khe ae hae neih hae zah, ‘Siapharan Adonijah tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!’ a ci hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama na ryalahtupaw kae, ranpibawi Zadok, Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah te na ryalahtupaw Solomon tuh oun ko khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Namaw koute siapharan ka bawipaw kya-e bawitungkhung kya hummou a haung cih cipaw kha na ryalahtupaw kae hynh nysah leite, siapharan ka bawipaw nynh e ryalaw hynh phe na law vae tou?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Siapharan lang Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David Siapharan nynh, “Bathsheba kha ka kalan yn kotua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Bathsheba tuh siapharan umnaw lang yn tee zah siapharan malang khe a thadyn. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Vawsawnaw miakaw kyate ka hiinnaw yn khumpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min phyate bya kae kinpakuh zah, ‘Na ccapaw Solomon tuh kamaw koute siapharan lang a tang cih zah, kamaw ccelang ka bawitungkhung kya a haung cih,’ kae cipya hawte, atunin ka cyih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tetuh Bathsheba nynh laekhu kya bakhungte siapharan kha sawtuanaw pya zah, “Ka bawipaw David Siapharan tuh zungzae hiin vae sah!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David Siapharan nynh, “Ranpibawi Zadok, profeh Nathan te Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah kha ka kalan oun ko oh,” a ci. Minmin tuh siapharan malang he a thua hae te, <verse number="33" style="v" />Siapharan nynh minmin kha, “Nae bawipaw kya-e ryalahtu hae kha ko oh lah, ka ccapaw Solomon kha ka lann kya ccisakuh oh lah, Gihon lang cciakhae bung oh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ranpibawi Zadok te profeh Nathan nynh tuin kyakhe Israel hae balyn a uktu siapharan lang chitui thuh hae sah; te mungkae tu oh lah, ‘Solomon Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!’ cite sia oh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Nanning nynh amaw kha na zui cih oh. Aning tuh yn tee cih zah ka bawitungkhung kya a haung cih; kamaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang cih; pawccecize aning kha Israel te Judah a uktu lang ka khang vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh siapharan kha, “Amen! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, siapharan ka bawipaw Pachia nynh mah tuhcite ho vae sah. <verse number="37" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh siapharan ka bawipaw kya a um hawte, Solomon kya mah um vae sah, te a bawitungkhung tuh ka bawipaw David Siapharan kya-e bawitungkhung laeze mah lesaehua vae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Te ranpibawi Zadok, profeh Nathan, Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah, Khereth hae te Peleth hae nynh cceih hae zah Solomon kha David Siapharan lann tungvaw ccisakuh hae zah Gihon lang a cciakhae hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ranpibawi Zadok nynh bu kya-e chitui ruinkuhpaw saki kha lah zah Solomon kha a thuh. Te mungkae kha tu hae zah ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Solomon Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!” cite a sia hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh amaw kha zui hae zah phyly tu biate, myaryamaw mih lungpaw zah laephi phe hy lan cia mih roi a saw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adonijah te a kya umpaw mikhia hae balyn nynh loohdangnaw poi a thangsah lya hae khe, tuh-e roi tuh a thae hae. Joab nynh mungkae roi he a thae tuh, “Khuapi lungkhu kya siarisiaraepaw roi tuh pawkeiccumou athua?” a ci. <verse number="42" style="v" />Bya a ho cciamang lyakhe, Ranpibawi Abiathar ccapaw Jonathan tuh yn thua. Adonijah nynh, “Yn tee, nang tuh mihoypaw na thua zah, thehoypaw kha nae thuakhae mamin cih,” a cipya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathan nynh Adonijah kha, “Thua khyh, ah bawipaw David Siapharan nynh Solomon kha siapharan lang a khang vae; <verse number="44" style="v" />siapharan nynh ranpibawi Zadok, profeh Nathan, Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah, Khereth hae te Peleth hae kha Solomon ryte saw hae zah, minmin nynh siapharan lann kha a ccisaku vae hae; <verse number="45" style="v" />ranpibawi Zadok te profeh Nathan nynh amaw kha Gihon kya siapharan lang chitui a thuh vae hae; tuin kyate lungtua lungpawte a cceihthung vae hae, tukeiccuze khuapi tuh siarisiarae um zah, tuh-e roi tuh nynh na thae. <verse number="46" style="v" />Solomon tuh siapharan bawitungkhung kya a haung. <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuhpiaze siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh ah bawipaw David Siapharan kha sawtuanaw pya lan cceih hae zah, ‘Pachia nynh Solomon min kha na min laeze athaanhua lante rae sah lah, a bawitungkhung kha na bawitungkhung laeze alesaehua lante rae vae sah,’ a ci hae. Siapharan tuh ikhung vawlan a lu bakhungte beik zah, <verse number="48" style="v" />‘Ka ciihan lu kheit kha ka bawitungkhung kya haungsah zah, tuh-e tuh yn muihsahtupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah,’ cite saw a sang,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tetuh Adonijah a mikhia hae balyn tuh thyngkute thokuh hae zah mih laanpi raveih lang a cceih vae hae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Adonijah tuh Solomon raw a ri keiccuze thokuh zah silawhang a ki hae kalan khe cceih zah a kyng. <verse number="51" style="v" />“Adonijah nynh Solomon raw a ri keiccuze silawhang a ki hae kha kyng zah, ‘Solomon Siapharan nynh a ryalahtupaw kae hynh thaloi te kae theih lan khyh cite masaty bya yn kinpakuh sah,’ a ci,” cite Solomon kha a hopya hae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon nynh, “Mihoypaw a thuanaw kha a langsah zetuh, a sangrua ccangkheit sanmah laekhu lang ccah lan khyh; thuasalama a tungvaw kya hoyleinaw muih athua zetuh a chih cih,” a ci. <verse number="53" style="v" />Te Solomon Siapharan nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah aning kha silawhang kyate a kosah hae. Aning tuh yn thua zah Solomon Siapharan kha sawtuanaw a pya; te Solomon nynh amaw kha, “Na inn lang la cceih,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Solomon Thuiheisyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tuh a chinaw ccyh nae vae zah a ccapaw Solomon kha byatawsya zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Laephi ccungccaw balyn nynh a ccianaw hae laanpi langkhe vyavya ka cceih vae cih. Na thawsae sah lah, na rawthung sah, <verse number="3" style="v" />na cyipaw miakaw te na ccianaw miakaw kya na laan na sui a ua nawlan, Moses phungbya kya azeiku hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae hopyapaw kha ngae lah, a laanpi kha zuite, a phunglang hae, a kawbya hae, a phungzae hae, ccaekia a khangkunaw hae kha zuitua. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kamaw konglang ho zah: ‘Na ccapaw hae nynh mih thinlung balyn te, mih hiinnaw balyn te ka malang khe lungzinaw te ccia khylan, mih laanpi kha a raeringku hae zetuh, Israel bawitungkhung vawlan a haung cih paw na ciihan tuh dae lan khyh,’ a cipaw bya kha a tynsah cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tuhpiaze Zeruiah ccapaw Joab nynh ka tungvaw a cyipaw kha mah phe na ny: aning nynh Israel rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi hae lu ning, Ner ccapaw Abner te Jether ccapaw Amasa kha a chia hae, rhawtuk lya chiise aluapaw hanlan kha rhaw adae ccyh lyakhe phulah hae zah, a tae kya-e taeccia kya te a ccu kya-e phanah kyakhe rhawtuk chiise kha a noi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">2Sa 3.27</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 20:10">20.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na hawnaw thyhte cyitua, thuasalama a sang apaw vae paw a lu kha Sheol khua lang daebabi lan cciasah nan. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Gilead ccungccaw Barzillai ccapaw hae kha tuh lungzinaw te ccuepe hae lah, na ccaboi kya looh ae hae paw kyakhe umbua hae sah; pawccecize na upaw Absalom kyate ka ccue lyaze minmin nynh tuhcihawpaw lungzinaw khate yn cciadue hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:27-29">2Sa 17.27-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahanaim khua lang ka ccia nin ze, kae kha thawte thya yn lawpaw Benjamin ccungccaw Bahurim khuapaw Gera ccapaw Shimei kha mah a um; thuasalama kae te tungku khylan Jordan vaw lang he yn cceihbung tuh, ‘Nang kha thaloi te kae theih lan khyh,’ cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate bya ka kinpyaku vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">2Sa 16.5-13</ref>, <ref loc="2SA 19:16-23">19.16-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze seinaw a hoi leipaw lang ria nan, pawccecize nang tuh a hawpaw nynh na thua; a tungvaw pawtemou cyi lan accan cipaw kha na nyh zah, a sang apaw vae paw a lu kha chiise te Sheol lang na cciasah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih zah David khua khe a uu hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />David nynh Israel ram kha kum sung pali a uk; Hebron kya kum sari uk zah Jerusalem kya sung thum kum thum a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2Sa 5.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1Sh 3.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomon tuh a paaw David kya-e bawitungkhung kya haung zah, a peenaw kha tynkaring lan a tynsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">1Sh 29.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh A Peenaw A Tynsah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Haggith ccapaw Adonijah nynh Solomon nung Bathsheba kalan yn cceih. Bathsheba nynh, “Daenaw tetou nae thua?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Daenaw te nynh kae thua,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “Na kya hopya lanpaw bya ka hoi,” a cipya. Bathsheba nynh, “Hotua,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Peenaw hynh kamaw kya-e thua zah, Israel hae balyn nynh ukku khylan yn ngaehoi hae paw kha na ny; tuhzemah peenaw tuh ka kuih kyate nuekuh zah, ka neitaw kuih kya a thua, pawccecize tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a pyapaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te atu na kya ngiaku kae rypaw ccangkheit um zah, tuh-e tuh beih yn ei nan,” a cipya. Bathsheba nynh, “Hotua,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Solomon Siapharan kha beih yn ngiapya tua—nang tuh ae ei lan khyh—Shunam khuanung Abishag kha ka zu lang beih yn pya sah,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3-4">1Si 1.3-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Bathsheba nynh, “Ahoy; namaw ccelang siapharan kha ka hopah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Adonijah ccelang bya hopya khylan Bathsheba tuh Solomon Siapharan kalan a cceih. Siapharan nynh amaw kha tungku khylan thokuh zah a malang khe a bakhung; te a bawitungkhung kya haung zah siapharan a nung elang haungnaw lawsah hae zah a ranglang khe a haung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te a nung nynh, “Ngia lanpaw adihpaw ccangkheit ka hoi; yn myapah nan,” a cipya. Te siapharan nynh, “Anung, yn ngiakuh; kae ei lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />A nung nynh, “Shunam khuanung Abishag kha na upaw Adonijah kalan a zu lang beih pya,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh a nung kha, “Adonijah hanlan Shunam khuanung Abishag kha pawccemou nae ngia? Peenaw hynh mah aning elang ngiapya bia! Pawccecize aning tuh ka upaw nynh thua; aning elang kyalya ngia leite ranpibawi Abiathar te Zeruiah ccapaw Joab elang mah ngiabia!” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate byakinkuh zah, “Adonijah nynh hynh-e a ngiapaw hanlan a hiinnaw kha a pya khyh zetuh, Pachia nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e ciate thuasah, tuhlaeze alung lante mah thuasah cyih vae sah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae kha yn tynsah zah ka paaw David kya-e bawitungkhung kya yn nung zah bya a kinku hawte ka ciihan yn raepahtupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, atunin Adonijah tuh chia athua cih,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon Siapharan nynh Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah kha a saw; aning nynh Adonijah kha theih zah a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ranpibawi Abiathar kha, “Anathoth khua lang, na inn na loo lang la cceih; nang tuh chi lan atekuhpaw nynh na thua. Thuasalama Bawipaw PACHIA thingkua kha ka paaw malang na la puih keiccu thuasah, ka paaw nynh vawsawnaw a teingpaw miakaw kha na la teingkhae keiccu thuasah atu tuh kae theih lan khyh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1Sa 22.20-23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:24">2Sa 15.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon nynh Abiathar tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a ranpibawi ryalaw kyate a phua, tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Eli ciihan te asekuh lante Shiloh khua kya bya a la hopaw kha a ccingsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">1Sa 2.27-36</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab nynh Absalom kha a la bawm khyh zemah Adonijah kha tuh a la bawm keiccuze, tuh-e the kha he a thae tuh, Joab nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bu kalan ccue zah, silawhang a ki hae kha phang a kyng hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan kyakhe, “Joab tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bu kalan ccue zah, atu silawhang pe phang um,” cite he a hopah hae tuh, Solomon nynh Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah kha saw zah, “La cceih lah, Joab kha la theih,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Benaiah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bu kalan cceih zah, Joab kyakhe, “Siapharan nynh, ‘Yn pou sah,’ ae ci,” a cipya. Joab nynh, “Ka pou lan khyh, e kya maw ka chih cih,” a ci. Te Benaiah nynh siapharan kalan khe bya kha cciakhae zah, “Joab nynh hynhte ho zah hynhte bya yn khung,” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Amaw nynh a ho hawte la cyih, la theih lah, la uh; tuhcite akonglang um leite Joab nynh a luasahpaw chiise hanlan seinaw kha ka tungvaw te ka paaw ciihan kyate thyaasah tua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Aning nynh amaw laeze dinghua hae zah a hoyhua hae paw lu ning, Ner ccapaw Abner, Israel rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawipaw te Jether ccapaw Amasa, Judah rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawipaw kha ka paaw David a ny lei lante, thaloi te chiise a luasahpaw cyisahnaw kha amaw lu vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccawsah cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuhcite tuh-e hae chiise tuh Joab lu vawlan te a ciihan hae lu vawlan khe zungzae accah thui cih; thuasalama David tungvaw te a ciihan hae tungvaw thuasah, a inn te a bawitungkhung kya thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thuapaw daenaw tuh zungzae a um cih,” a ci. <verse number="34" style="v" />Te Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh cceihthung zah Joab kha a theih koute ramkaw e amaw a inn kyakhe a uu hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah kha Joab ccelang rhawkaw hae a uktu lang nung zah, ranpibawi Zadok kha Abiathar ccelang ranpibawi lang a nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Shimei kha kosah hae zah, “Jerusalem kya inn sakkuh lah, umbua; tuin khua kyate teitei lang mah pou nan. <verse number="37" style="v" />Pawccecize na pou zah Kidron vawkhu he na zua nin khe, na chih ccaccing cih cipaw kha nyku tua; na chiise tuh namaw lu vawlan accah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Shimei nynh siapharan kha, “Na hopaw tuh ahoy; siapharan ka bawipaw nynh na ho hawte, na ryalahtupaw nynh ka cyih cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Shimei tuh Jerusalem kya khaw cia a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama kum thum he aro te, Shimei see hae lu ning tuh Gath siapharan Maakah ccapaw Akhish kalan a ccue hae. Shimei kha, “Gath khua kya na see hae a um hae,” cite he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="40" style="v" />Shimei nynh thokuh zah lann kha khungnin a dekuh koute a see hae kha ccung khylan Gath khua lang Akhish kalan a cceih; Shimei nynh cceih zah Gath khua kyate a see hae kha a kikhae hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Shimei tuh Jerusalem kyate Gath lang cceih zah yn ki vae cite Solomon kha he a hopah hae tuh, <verse number="42" style="v" />siapharan nynh Shimei kha kosah hae zah amaw kha, “Khua kyate na pou zah ccanglang na ccia nin kya na chih cih cipaw ccaerarih lan nykuh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate bya kae kinsakuh zah, ccaerarih lan kae hopah khyh tou? Nang nynh kae kha, ‘Na hopaw tuh ahoy, ka nawccah,’ nae cipya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bya na kinkupaw te kae nynh kae hopyapaw kawbya kha pawccemou na zui khyh?” a cipya. <verse number="44" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Shimei kha, “Ka paaw David tungvaw na cyipaw hoyleinaw balyn kha na thinlung kya phe na ny; tukeiccuze na hoyleinaw kha namaw lu vawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccawsah cih. <verse number="45" style="v" />Thuasalama Solomon Siapharan tuh hythuapya athua cih zah, David kya-e bawitungkhung tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang zungzae atyn cih,” a cipya. <verse number="46" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah kha kaw a pya; te Benaiah nynh cceih zah Shimei kha theih zah a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuhcite peenaw tuh Solomon kuih kya atyn.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Hawnaw A Ngiaku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2Sh 1.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh Izip siapharan Faro ryte nawccawkheihnaw kha zudynaw te a rae; aning nynh Faro ccanung kha dykuh zah amaw inn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te Jerusalem khualungrua kha a lyn mawlaezung David khua khe a umsah. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min hanlan inn kha sak athua loh khyh keiccuze ccungccaw hae nynh ahangnaw hmin khe silawnaw kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha sungsah zah, a paaw David phungbya hae kha a zui; thuasalama ahangnaw hmin khe silaw zah mynkhuhpaw kha maee te a u. <verse number="4" style="v" />Siapharan tuh silaw khylan Gibeon lang a cceih, pawccecize tuh-e tuh alepaw hmin hangpaw nynh thua; Solomon nynh tuh-e silawhang vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw thong kheit kha leih a rae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeon khua kya khuazi a mang kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Solomon kalan yn langkuh zah, Pachia nynh, “Pawmou kae pya cih, yn ngiakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Solomon nynh, “Na ryalahtupaw ka paaw David tuh namaw malang lungzinaw te, dingnaw te, thinlung hmerarih te a um keiccuze alepaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw kha na langsapyaku vae; amaw hanlan hynh-e alepaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw kha na nungpah zah, atunin a bawitungkhung kya a haung cih paw ccapaw kha na pya vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Atu tuh, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, imua taraw ka thua zemah, na ryalahtupaw hynh ka paaw David hmin kya siapharan lang nae nung vae; kae tuh pawtemou pou lan zah pawtemou tee lan cipaw ka nykuh khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te milu riatae leipaw myarya lung hae paw minphuin pi, namaw nynh na popaw ccungccaw hae laku kya nynh na ryalahtupaw tuh ka um. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na ccungccaw hae hynh uk kho nawlan, ahoypaw te athahpaw phia khonawpaw nythyanaw thinlung kha na ryalahtupaw hynh beih yn pya; pawccecize hynh-e na minphuin pi hynh hum nynh mou a uk kho cih?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh a ngiapaw bya nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a lungry a thuasah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia nynh amaw kha, “Nang nynh hiinshe saenaw, hoirumnaw te na rhaw hae hiinnaw kha ngiaku leite, namaw hanlan ahmepaw nythya nawlan hawnaw kha nae ngiaku, <verse number="12" style="v" />na bya thyhte ka cyih cih. Hawnaw te nythyanaw thinlung kha kae pya; nang na mawze nang ae lopaw lu kheit san la um boi khyh zah, nang na koute mah nang ae lopaw lu kheit san langkuh vae lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te nae ngiaku leipaw hoirumnaw te sawtuanaw kha na hiin lungkhu balyn kae pya; nang te touse lanpaw ccangpaw siapharan humhung mah um lan khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na paaw David nynh a zui hawte, ka laanpi kha na zui zah ka phungbya hae te ka kawbya hae kha na zui zetuh, na hiinshe kae saesah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Solomon tuh a inaw kyate thaekuh zah, tuh-e tuh a mang nynh thua. Jerusalem lang cceih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua malang khe a thadyn. Aning nynh maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha rae zah, a ryalahtu hae balyn kha loohdangnaw a raepya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Byapianaw kya Solomon Hawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te ohhuanung hae lu ning nynh oun cceih hae zah siapharan malang a thadyn hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Lu kheit nung nynh, “Ka bawipaw, e nopinung te kae tuh inn kheit kya kae umkheih; inn kya kae umkheih lyakhe ccaaw ka saahku. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ccaaw a pui koute nin thumnaw nin khe e nopinung nynh mah ccaaw saahkuh zah, pynkheihlan kae umkheih; tuh-e inn kya kaemaw lu ning kyalya kae um zah, milae humhung mah umbua khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />E nopinung nynh khuazi khe a ccapaw kha a nethin keiccuze phe a chih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ziraccyng khe aning nynh tho zah, ka pe e ka ccapaw kha na ryalahtunung ka itheih lyakhe zya lah zah, a by vaw khe a nung, te achihpaw a ccapaw kha ka by vaw khe a nung. <verse number="21" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua khe ka ccapaw kha matei zusah lan he ka tho tuh, a chihpaw kha ka muih; thuasalama awkhua khe hoyte ka do tuh, ka saahkupaw ccapaw thua khyh cipaw phe aria,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama ccangpaw nopinung nynh, “Thua khyh, ahiinpaw imua tuh ka ccapaw thua zah, achihpaw imua tuh na ccapaw nynh thua,” a ci. Masaty e nopinung nynh, “Thua khyh, achihpaw imua tuh na ccapaw thua zah, ahiinpaw imua tuh ka ccapaw nynh thua,” a ci. Tuhcite siapharan malang khe a eikuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh, “Lu kheit nynh, ‘E a hiinpaw hynh ka ccapaw thua zah, a chihpaw hynh na ccapaw nynh thua,’ na ci oh; te ccangpaw lu kheit nynh, ‘Tuhte thua khyh! Na ccapaw tuh a chih, a hiinpaw hynh ka ccapaw nynh thua,’ na ci oh,” a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh, “Thaloi yn pya oh,” ci zah thaloi kha a malang a thuakhaepya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Ahiinpaw imuapaw hynh ccangning lang thoh bua oh lah, e nopi hae lu ning hynh anganngankuhte pya oh,” a ci. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuasalama a hiinpaw imua a nung nynh—a ccapaw kha myarya ngaethya a umsah keiccuze—siapharan kha, “Ka bawipaw, ahiinpaw imua hynh amaw kha pya ccaleih; beih theih nan!” a cipya. Ccangpaw lu kheit nynh, “Ka kya-e mah thua nan sah, na kya-e mah thua nan sah; thoh bua oh,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh khung hae zah, “Ahiinpaw ccaaw kha theih nan oh, masaty e nopinung kha pya oh. Aning tuh imua a nung nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="28" style="v" />Siapharan nynh bya a piapaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh thae hae zah siapharan tungvaw rawri sawtuanaw a hoi hae, pawccecize byading te byapia kho nawlan Pachia hawnaw tuh a tungvaw a um cipaw a ny hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Kuihkaw e Bawi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan tuh Israel ram pynpi a uktu siapharan thua zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />e hae hynh a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh thua hae: Zadok ccapaw Azariah tuh ranpibawi nynh thua; <verse number="3" style="v" />Shisha ccapaw hae Elihoref te Ahijah tuh ryaccinkhan hae nynh thua; Ahilud ccapaw Jehoshafat tuh ccazing kyngtu nynh thua; <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah tuh rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi nynh thua; Zadok te Abiathar tuh ranpibawi hae nynh thua; <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathan ccapaw Azariah tuh bawi hae a uktupaw bawi nynh thua; Nathan ccapaw Zabud tuh ranpibawi thua zah siapharan a banpaw mah athua; <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahishar tuh siapharan inn a do-oihtu nynh thua; Abda ccapaw Adoniram tuh nangsete ryalawsahnaw kya a uktu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon nynh Israel ram pynpi a uktu bawi lu haw lae ning a hoi, minmin nynh siapharan te a innbyn hae hanlan looh kha a paccynpya hae; kum kheit lungkhu kya lu kheit nynh sawpaw sah kheit cci hanlan looh a paccynpya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e hae min tuh: Efraim muaram kyaze Ben-hur; <verse number="9" style="v" />Makaz, Shaalbim, Beth-shemesh te Elon-beth-hanan khua hae kyaze Bendeker; <verse number="10" style="v" />Arubboth khua kyaze Benhesed, (Sokoh khua te Hefer ram balyn tuh amaw kya-e nynh thua); <verse number="11" style="v" />Nafath-dor ram pynpi kyaze Ben-abinadab (a zu tuh Solomon ccanung Tafath nynh thua); <verse number="12" style="v" />Taanak khua, Megiddo khua te Jezreel khua akawlan e Zarethan khua pe umpaw Beth-shean khua pepan balyn, Beth-shean khua kyate Abelmeholah khua kyacia, te Jokmeam khua akhung lang kyacia looh a paccyntu tuh Ahilud ccapaw Baana nynh thua; <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramoth-gilead kyaze Ben-geber (aning nynh Gilead ram kya Manasseh ccapaw Jair kya-e khua hae kha a hoi hae, te Bashan ram umpaw Argob pee lungkhu kya-e khualungrua te sohin thuakawccaw a umpaw khua lepaw sung taruh); <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahanaim khua kyaze Iddo ccapaw Ahinadab; <verse number="15" style="v" />Naftali ram kyaze Ahimaaz (a zu tuh Solomon ccanung Basemath nynh thua); <verse number="16" style="v" />Asher ram te Bealoth khua kyaze Hushai ccapaw Baana; <verse number="17" style="v" />Issakhar ram kyaze Paruah ccapaw Jehoshafat; <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin ram kyaze Ela ccapaw Shimei; <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor hae siapharan Sihon te Bashan siapharan Og nynh a la uk hae paw Gilead ram kyaze Um ccapaw Geber nynh thua. Te Judah ram kya bawi lu kheit a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Uknaw kha Kosahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah hae te Israel hae tuh rili kin e laesia zeih acih hae; ae hae neih hae zah lungpawte a um hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon nynh Zufrates kyate Filistin hae ram te Izip ramri kyacia ram balyn kha a uk; Solomon a hiin lungkhu balyn ngunto pya hae zah amaw kha rya a lawpya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Gen 15.18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:26">2Sh 9.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon hanlan nin kheit athangpaw looh tuh ahoypaw vaekhui kor sung thum, chanvuih kor sung taruh, <verse number="23" style="v" />tangnuapaw athopaw sa haw, rampaeekunaw kya-e vaetua sa kuin te tuu za kheit te sazuh, sakhi, sazaw te thobaleih lan kuapaw pavaw phuin nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize aning nynh Zufrates vaw kyate niccaw lang ram balyn, Tifsah kyate Gaza khua kyacia, Zufrates vaw niccaw lang e siapharan hae balyn kha uk hae zah, teitei lang balyn daenaw a um. <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon a hiin lungkhu balyn tuh Judah hae te Israel hae tuh Dan kyate Beersheba kyacia, mih misu ku te mih thaeku ku raveih khate khyndadyh lan khua a sah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon nynh a marangle a suepaw marang hae kunawpaw marang inn thong sung pali te marang rhawkaw thong haw lae ning kha mah a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">1Si 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:14">2Sh 1.14</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 9:25">9.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Solomon Siapharan te Solomon Siapharan a aenaw ccaboi kalan a thua hae paw balyn hanlan looh kha tuh-e bawi hae nynh lu kheit ze sah kheit ccite ahobounaw a um lei lan a paccyn hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin nynh mimaw rya raveih thyhte, marang hae te ahyhpaw marang hae hanlan barli te ccatanphue kha ahonaw hmin takyh lang a thuakhaepya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Hawnaw Minthaannaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pachia nynh Solomon kha myarya lepaw hawnaw, nythyanaw, rili kin e laesia zeih acihpaw thaethyanaw akopaw kha a pya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon hawnaw tuh nithua lang ccungccaw balyn hawnaw te Izip hae hawnaw balyn laeze alehua. <verse number="31" style="v" />Aning tuh humhung laeze a hawhua, Ezrah ccungccaw Ethan te Mahol ccapaw hae Heman, Kalkol te Darda laeze a hawhua; a minthaannaw tuh a pepan e minphuin hae balyn kya pong zeihkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89">Sam 89</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Phungtangbya thong thum te hlawphua thong kheit hlaw pangaw a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:1">Ptb 1.1</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 10:1">10.1</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 25:1">25.1</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 1:1">Sol 1.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Lebanon kya apopaw sidar thing kyate tho zah lungrua kya apopaw hyssop ku kyacia thingku kong kha a ho; sarangpaw, pavaw, avawpaw te ngasaw kong kha mah a ho. <verse number="34" style="v" />Solomon hawnaw kha thaetua khylan minphuin takyh kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh oun ccianua hae; minmin tuh a hawnaw kong a thaepaw laephi vaw e siapharan balyn nynh oun saw hae zah oun thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Sak lan Paccynkunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2Sh 2.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon kha a paaw ccelang siapharan lang chitui a thuh vae hae cipaw kha Tair siapharan Hiram nynh he a thae tuh, a ryalahtu hae kha a kalan a saw hae; pawccecize Hiram tuh David a banpaw lang po a tangpaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon nynh Hiram kha byataw zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka paaw David tuh a rhaw hae nynh po voilu lante a tuk hae keiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a rhaw hae tuh a ccuphe kaw a nung mawlaezung hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia min hanlan inn kha sak kho khyh cipaw phe na ny. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia nynh pawpaw kya balyn haeungnaw yn pya vae zah, rawsenaw thuasah, vethyanaw thuasah um khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka paaw David kha, ‘Namaw ccelang na bawitungkhung kya ka nung cih paw na ccapaw nynh ka min hanlan inn kha a sak cih,’ cite a hopya thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia min hanlan inn sak lan ka paccynkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Sa 7.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1Sh 17.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kamaw elang Lebanon mua e sidar thing kha nge khylan kawpya hae. Ka ryalahtu hae nynh na ryalahtu hae kha a bawm cih hae zah, nang nynh na ryalahtu hae hanlan ryalaw mee na khya thyhte kae pya cih; pawccecize Sidon hae hawte thing nge athyapaw kaening kya humhung mah um khyh cipaw na ny,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiram nynh Solomon bya kha he a thae tuh, myarya a lungtua zah, “E minphuin pi a uktu lang David kha ccapaw ahawpaw a pyatupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh thehoyte um sah,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiram nynh Solomon kha byataw zah, “Bya nae tawpaw kha ka thae vae; sidar thing te maeccaw thing kha na ry zeih kae ccingsahpah cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu hae nynh Lebanon mua kyate rili kalan a cciakhae bung cih hae; tuh-e thingtung hae kha phum lang ka rae cih zah, na paccynnaw hmin langkhe rili kyate a cciakhae cih hae, te tuin kyakhe ka phousah cih hae zah nang nynh na lawkuh cih; nang nynh ka innbyn hae kha looh pyate ka rynaw kha nae ccingsahpah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh a rypaw miakaw sidar thing te maeccaw thing kha Hiram nynh a pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomon nynh mah Hiram kha a innbyn hae elang aepaw chanvuih kor thong kuin te chitui hoypaw kor ccangkuin kha a pyaru. Solomon nynh Hiram kha tuh-e tuh kum takyh a pya. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinpyaku thyhte, Solomon kha hawnaw a pya. Hiram te Solomon laku kya daenaw um zah, mih lu ning te nawccawthungkunaw kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh Israel hae balyn kya-e ccungccaw thong sung thum kha nangsete ryalawnaw kya a nung hae; <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawpaw sah kheit ze thong haw ccite palei rulaete Lebanon lang a saw hae; Lebanon kya sah kheit, innvaw sah ning leih a um hae; Adoniram tuh nangsete ryalawsahnaw kya a uktu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:18">1Si 12.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon nynh phupaw ryalahtu thong sung sari te muaram kya lung-awtu thong sung tarya a hoi; <verse number="16" style="v" />tuhpiaze, Solomon nynh ryalahtu hae a dopahtu ccungccaw thong thum za thum a hoi. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kaw a pya hae thyhte, inn aleihpaw kha cyithuipaw lung te rae khylan, alepaw lung te amee rupaw lung kha a khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhcite innsakthya hae paw Solomon ccungccaw hae, Hiram ccungccaw hae te Gebal khuaccaaw hae nynh beikinn sak nawlan lung hae te thing hae kha a paccyn hae.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Beikinn A Sak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pounaw hae te kum za pali sung taryanaw kum, Solomon nynh Israel hae a uknaw hae kum palinaw kum, sawpaw sah ningnaw athuapaw Ziv saw kyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn sak kha a tho. <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh a sakpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn tuh asaepaw dong sung taruh, akopaw dong kuin te ahangpaw dong sung thum acih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Beikinn akhaanpi malang umpaw tee takawnaw khaan tuh beikinn akopaw te lokuh zah asaepaw dong kuin, akopaw dong haw acih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Beikinn a aw ccaw cite abypaw thanlan-aw hae kha a rae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Inn akhaanpi atolang pang te alungkhu lang e hminthyaa atolang pang kha po voilu lan akhaan taraw hae kha a rae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Akaw khang tuh dong pangaw ko zah, angaelung khang tuh dong taruh ako, te khang thumnaw tuh dong sari ako; a doupaw thingccaw hae tuh inn pang lungkhu lang a tee khyh nawlan, inn atolang pang kha palung khang tuh alia khang laeze apahhua lante po voilu lan a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Beikinn saknawpaw lung hae kha lung lawnaw hmin kya raety vae paw lung athua keiccuze beikinn a sak lya hae khe alungkhu kya khynlyng roi, hae roi, sivaw zunghe roi pawpaw mah thae lan um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Angaelung khang teenaw tuh beikinn alia lang khate nynh a um; akuekuhpaw nawkui khate angaelung khang lang thuasah, angaelung khang kyate khang thumnaw kalan thuasah kae athua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite beikinn kha sak zah a lyn; te beikinn kha sidar thingccaw te thingphe khate a daw. <verse number="10" style="v" />Beikinn po voilu lan pang kya a sakpaw akhaan taraw hae tuh dong pangaw cci hang zah, sidar thing hae khate inn kya a kyngsaku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Solomon kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="12" style="v" />“E na sak cciamangpaw inn te asekuh lante, ka phungbya kha ngaete ka phungzae hae kha na zui zah, ka kawbya balyn kha na zui zetuh, na paaw David kya bya ka kinpyakupaw kha na tungvaw ka tynsah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel hae kya ka um cih zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha ka vua lan khyh hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon nynh inn kha sak zah a lyn. <verse number="15" style="v" />Beikinn pang kha alungkhu langte suarui kyate siling adawkuhpaw kyacia sidar thingphe a be; suarui kha maeccaw thingphe te a rae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Inn nulang dong kuin kha suarui kyate adawkuhpaw kyacia sidar thingphe te rae zah, e hynh alungkhu lang e hminthyaa lante, hmin thyaa huaccepaw lang a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:33-34">Exo 26.33-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang umpaw inn akhaanpi tuh dong sung pali asae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Inn lungkhu e sidar thing hae tuh tui-ung thae te haetapaw zuh kha a soi hae; abalyn mawte sidar thing nynh thua, lung tuh lang khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua nung nawlan, inn alungkhu lang kou khe alungkhu lang e hminthyaa kha a paccyn. <verse number="20" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e hminthyaa alungkhu tuh dong kuin asae, dong kuin ko zah, dong kuin ahang; tuh-e akhaan tuh sui ccipaw te a thei. Silawhang kha mah sidar thing te a rae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon nynh inn alungkhu kha sui ccipaw te thei zah, alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang khe sui rui kha po raw zah, sui te a thei. <verse number="22" style="v" />Inn pynpi tuh accingpaw athua nawlan, inn kha abalynte sui a thei; alungkhu lang e hminthyaa kya-e silawhang kha heize abalynte sui a thei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">Exo 30.1-3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Ccaannaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e hminthyaa lungkhu khe dong haw cci ahangpaw cherubim ccangning kha oliv thing te a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.23-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-20">Exo 25.18-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Cherub sake ccangkheit tuh dong pangaw sae zah, cherub sake ccangpaw ccangkheit tuh dong pangaw asae; tukeiccuze a sake voikheit lang dung kyate voikheit lang kyacia dong haw acih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccangpaw cherub ccangkheit tuh mah dong haw acihbua; ccangning mawte mih muinsan te adi-ale hae paw phe lokuh hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Cherub ccangkheit tuh dong haw ahang, ccangpaw cherub mah tuhmaminte ahangbua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Cherubim hae kha inn alungkhu lang kou khe a nung; cherub sake hae tuh daw hae zah, cherub ccangkheit sake nynh pang voikheih lang kha dia zah, ccangpaw cherub ccangkheit sake nynh pang voikheih lang kha adia; ccangpaw mih sake hae tuh inn ngaelung khe ccangkheit te ccangkheit a tungkuh hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Cherubim kha mah ccangning mawte sui te a thei hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Inn pang hae kyakhe akhaan alungkhu lang te thuasah, atolang te thuasah po voilu lan cherubim zuh, ungcci ku zuh te haetapaw zuh hae a soi hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Inn kya-e suarui kha akhaan alungkhu lang te thuasah, atolang te thuasah sui te a thei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e hminthyaa kalan teenaw thuakaw hae kha oliv thing te a rae; thuakawccaw te thuakawtung hae tuh apaki ccangpangaw a hoi hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Oliv thing te raekuhpaw thuakaw ccangning kha cherubim zuh, ungcci ku zuh te haetapaw hae zuh kha soi hae zah sui te a thei hae, te cherubim te ungcci ku hae kha sui te a ccaan hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuhawte inn khaanpi kalan teenaw thuakaw tung hae kha mah oliv thing te, apaki ki pali a um lante a rae hae, <verse number="34" style="v" />maeccaw thing te thuakaw ccangning rae zah, thuakaw voikheit lang elang pahta ccangning cci a rae keiccuze khawthya hungthya a um hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuakaw hae kyakhe cherubim zuh, ungcci ku zuh te haetapaw hae zuh kha karynte soi zah, azuh apyaanaw kyakhe sui te a thei. <verse number="36" style="v" />Alungkhu lang e voidu kha raethuipaw lung thyh thum te sidar thingphe thyh kheit khate a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kum palinaw, Ziv sawpaw kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn aleihpaw kha a bing hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Kum haw lae kheitnaw, sawpaw sah taryanaw Bul sawpaw kyakhe inn kha paccyn thyhte akhaan riadawpaw ryalaw balyn kha a lyn hae. Solomon nynh kum sari lungkhu inn kha a sak.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Inn te Ccangpaw Inn hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh amaw inn kha kum haw lae thum lungkhu sak zah, a inn kha abalyn mawte a lyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lebanon Tuhpi Inn a ci hae paw kha sak zah, asaepaw dong za kheit, akopaw dong sung pangaw, ahangpaw dong sung thum acih; tuh-e inn tuh tang pali lang bingpaw sidar thingtung hae te tuh-e tung hae kya huepaw sidar thingccaw hae khate a sak. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tang kheit kyaze tung haw lae pangaw cci um zah, tung sung pali tung pangaw vawlan umpaw dawnawpaw accaw hae vawlan khe sidar thing te a daw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tang thum kyakhe thanlan-aw accaw hae um hae zah, ccangkheit te ccangkheit tuh tang thum kyakhe a hawiliakuh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuakaw hae te thanlan-aw hae balyn tuh apaki ki pali umpaw thua hae zah, tang thum kyakhe ccangkheit te ccangkheit a hawiliakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tungpi Khaan a ci hae paw kha rae zah, tuh-e tuh dong sung pangaw sae zah dong sung thum ako. Tung hae malang khe zekaw taraw um zah, tuh-e hae malang khe zokhawboei a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawitungkhung Khaan a ci hae paw kha a rae, byapianaw lanpaw thua zah Byading Khaan cite mah acikuh, suarui ccangkheit kyate ccangkheit kyacia sidar thing te a daw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Solomon a umnaw lanpaw inn, Byading Khaan anulang a umpaw kha mah tuhmaminte a sak hae. Zu lang a dykupaw Faro ccanung elang inn kha mah tuh-e Byading Khaan hawte a sakpya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">1Si 3.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E inn hae balyn tuh atolang te voidu lepaw kyacia, aleihpaw kyate adung kyacia amee rupaw lung te a sak hae; lung hae tuh tounawpaw te tou thyhte awpaw, nulang malang thing-aw te awpaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Inn aleihpaw e lung tuh dong tarya te dong haw sae zah, amee rupaw lung lepaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A vawlan khe amee rupaw lung, tounawpaw te tou thyhte raepaw lung te sidar thing a um hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Voidu lepaw tuh cyithuipaw lung thyh thum, sidar thingccaw thyh kheit te po voilu lan koihpaw nynh thua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn alungkhu lang e voidu te tuh-e inn tee takawnaw khaan kha tuhmaminte a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hiram A Ryalaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh Tair khua umpaw Hiram kha byataw zah a ko. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning tuh Naftali phin nomaenung ccapaw thua zah, a paaw tuh Tair khuapaw a kuihhae hoypaw nynh thua; aning tuh sohin raenaw kya a puakuhpaw, hawnaw te nythyanaw a hoipaw nynh thua. Solomon kalan cceih zah a rya miakaw kha a lawpya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiram nynh sohin tung tungning kha sohin te a laee. Tung tungkheit tuh dong haw lae tarya hang zah, dong haw lae ning asaepaw arui te a voi; tung ningnaw tuh mah tuhmaminte a cyi. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tung dung kya nung lanpaw tunglukhung ccangning kha sohin te a rae; tuh-e ccangkheit tuh dong pangaw hang zah, ccangpaw ccangkheit mah dong pangaw ahang. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tung dung hae kya umpaw tunglukhung hae elang miabu hawte akhelekuhpaw sohinrui hae kha a rae; tunglukhung ccangkheit cci hanlan tuh-e akhelekuhpaw ccangsari cci kha a rae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tung vawlan umpaw lukhung a vawlan khe, tuh-e lukhung ccangkheit elang sohin ccalee thae atang tang ning kha a rae; ccangpaw lukhung elang mah tuhmaminte a rae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tee takawnaw khaan kya-e tung hae dung a bongpaw lukhung hae tuh lili haetapaw te lokuh zah dong pali ahang. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e lukhung hae tuh atung tung ning vawlan te miabu hawte akhelekuhpaw pe umpaw athualaepaw vawlan khe a um hae; tung dung ccangkheit kyaze ccalee thae za ning ccite atang po voilu lante a um hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tung hae tuh beikinn tee takawnaw khaan kyakhe a bing hae; alia langsang khe tung kha bing zah Jakhin cite min a phu; thahlang sang khe mah tung kha bing zah Boaz cite min a phu. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tung dung hae vawlan khe lili haetapaw alo lante a rae; tuhcite tung ryalaw kha a lyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te sohin tuikua kha apyng lante rae zah, voikheih lang arae te voikheih lang arae tuh dong haw sawkuh zah, dong pangaw ahang. Po voilu lan tou lanze dong sung thum acih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuikua arae zakaw khe po voilu lante dong kheit ze tui-ung ccanghaw ccite tui-ung atang tang ning kha tuikua po voilu lan sohin te a laee. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e tuikua tuh tangnuapaw sa haw lae ning vawlan khe a um, tangnuapaw hae sa thum tuh thahlang, sa thum tuh niccaw lang, sa thum tuh alia lang, sa thum tuh nithua lang a hawi hae. Tuikua tuh mih tungvaw khe um zah, atolang khe pong a hawi hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuikua tuh zapae thaw zah, arae tuh banang rae hawte thua zah, lili haetapaw te alokuh; tuikua tuh tui kha bath thong ning accawng.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Hiram nynh sohin le ccanghaw a rae; le ccangkheit tuh dong pali asae, dong pali ko zah dong thum ahang. <verse number="28" style="v" />E hynh tuh-e le pungsan raenaw nynh thua: le hae tuh po voilu lante atang hoi hae zah, tuh-e atang hae tuh tung hae laku kya nynh a um hae; <verse number="29" style="v" />tuh-e tung hae laku umpaw atang hae kyakhe chindeih hae, tangnuapaw hae te cherubim zuh kha a rae hae. A tung kyakhe mah chindeih hae te tangnuapaw hae zuh mih vawlan te mih zakaw khe haetapawsi zuh a um. <verse number="30" style="v" />Le ccangkheit cci nynh sohin leccu ccangpali ccite sohin leccaw a hoi hae; pakepi khang nawlan apaki ki pali kyakhe a doutu um hae zah, tuh-e hae tuh haetapawsi hae ryte mih umnaw raveih khe a ccaande hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Zalung pake arae tuh dong kheit ko; aleihpaw hawte pyng zah dong kheit lae angankuh acih. Arae kyakhe deihthuite ccaanpaw a um hae; atang hae tuh apaki ki pali um zah pyng khyh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Leccu ccupali tuh atang hae zakaw um hae zah, leccaw hae tuh le kaw khe a um hae; leccu tuh dong kheit lae angankuh ahang. <verse number="33" style="v" />Leccu tuh marangle ccu hawte rae athua; leccaw hae, leccu khu arae hae, accu kya bingpaw ccungngue hae te accu kya bingpaw ccungngue a khawtu hae balyn kha sohin te a laee hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Le apaki ki pali kyakhe dounawpaw ccangpali cci um hae zah, le te po kyngkuh hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Le adung khe khaw kheit acihpaw sohin pyngkalynpaw a um; le dounawpaw te atang hae tuh le te po kyngkuh hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Dounawpaw hae te atang hae tuh cherubim, chindeih te ungcci ku zuh te a ccaan hae; accawnghannaw miakaw kyakhe haetapaw zuh kha a soi hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuhcite le ccanghaw kha a rae; mih balyn mawte a muinsan te adi-ale pong lokuh lante a laee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hiram nynh pakepi ccanghaw kha sohin te a rae; tuh-e zalung ccangkheit cci tuh dong pali ko zah, bath sung pali cci accawng. Le ccanghaw hae tuh ccangkheit cci kya pakepi ccangkheit cci kha a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Exo 30.17-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v" />Beikinn alia langkhe le ccangpangaw nung zah, thahlang khe le ccangpangaw a nung; tuikua kha inn nithua-alia lang apaki khe a nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hiram nynh ang hae, buhhawlua hae te pakepi hae kha a rae hae. Tuhcite Hiram nynh Solomon Siapharan elang <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe rya balyn kha a lyn. <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuh-e hae tuh: tung tungning, tung dung kya umpaw tunglukhung ccangning, tung dung hae kya umpaw tunglukhung hae bong lanpaw miabu hawte akhelekuhpaw hae, <verse number="42" style="v" />tung vawlan umpaw tunglukhung ccangning kha a bong lanpaw miabu ccangning elang ccalee thae za pali, tuh-e miabu ccangkheit cci elang ccalee thae atang tang ning, <verse number="43" style="v" />le ccanghaw, le vawlan umpaw pakepi ccanghaw, <verse number="44" style="v" />tuikua ccangkheit te tuikua kaw umpaw tangnuapaw ahaw lae ning nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ang hae, buhhawlua hae, pakepi hae, e hae balyn hynh Hiram nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn hanlan Solomon Siapharan elang awrarihpaw sohin te a raepya. <verse number="46" style="v" />Jordan accya, Sukkoth te Zarethan laku umpaw anglae laephi kyakhe siapharan nynh e hae hynh a laee hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuh-e angphe hae balyn tuh eih alung keiccuze Solomon nynh aripaw tou leite a nung hae; tuh-e sohin nynh aripaw tuh ny kho um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw uccaw hae balyn kha a rae: sui silawhang, Nungpyapaw sanlou nung nawlan sui ccaboi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Exo 25.23-30</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 30:1-3">30.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="49" style="v" />alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang umpaw sui ccite raepaw maeekhuatung hae—alia lang ccangpangaw, thahlang ccangpangaw; sui haetapaw hae, sui maeekhua hae, sui tetakia hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Exo 25.31-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="50" style="v" />sui ccite raepaw banang hae, tetakia hae, pakepi hae, mynkhuhpaw hanlan pake hae, maee-e nungnawpaw pake hae; beikinn alungkhu lang kou, hmin thyaa huaccepaw kya-e thuakaw hae elang te beikinn inn khaanpi kya-e thuakaw hae elang sui pahta hae kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn elang rya a lawpaw balyn tuh a thangsah. A paaw David nynh a hlupaw uccaw hae: sui, ngun te angphe hae kha teekhae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu e sisuainn kyakhe a ccy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:11">2Sa 8.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:11">1Sh 18.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Apnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2Sh 5.2—6.2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha Zion cikuhpaw David khua kyate cciakhae khylan, Solomon nynh Israel piccan hae balyn, mih phin raveih kya-e lu hae balyn, Israel ciihan cciakhaetu hae balyn kha Jerusalem khua, Solomon Siapharan malang a pum hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:12-16">2Sa 6.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-29">1Sh 15.25-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw balyn tuh sawpaw sah sarinaw Ethanim saw lungkhu poi kyakhe Solomon Siapharan malang a sueluakuh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:24">Lev 23.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel piccan hae balyn tuh oun cceih hae zah, ranpibawi hae nynh thingkua kha a puih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua, tungkunaw bu te bu kya umpaw athyaapaw angphe hae balyn kha ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh a cciakhae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan te a malang pumkuh hae paw Israel zapi hae balyn nynh amaw ryte thingkua malang khe myarya lungpaw tuu hae te tangnuapaw hae riatae um leipaw khate si a law hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha beikinn alungkhu lang e hminthyaa kya, hmin thyaa huaccepaw kya, cherubim sake hae zakaw, amaw hmin kyakhe a nung hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize cherubim hae nynh mih sake hae kha thingkua umnaw luki khe daw hae zah, thingkua te puihnawpaw ccong hae kha a dawpya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Puihnawpaw ccong hae tuh eih asae keiccuze adung kha alungkhu lang e hminthyaa malang, hminthyaa kyate muih kho athua; thuasalama atolang te muih kho thua khyh; atunin cia tuin kya a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pou lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin ryte byakinnaw a raenaw Horeb mua kya Moses nynh a la sangpaw lungphe phe ning laelan, thingkua lungkhu kya ccangpaw pawpaw mah um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:5">Deu 10.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh hminthyaa kyate he a pou hae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn tuh maeking phe abeih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Exo 40.34-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />maeking keiccuze ranpibawi hae tuh ryalaw lan thadyn kho khyh hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Solomon nynh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:11">Sam 18.11</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 97:2">97.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“Varyng zipingpaw mohnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka um cih cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sung-epaw inn,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae na umnaw lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hmin kha kae sakpya vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Bya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2Sh 6.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Israel zapi hae balyn a thadyn lya hae khe, siapharan nynh a nulang maeleihkuh zah Israel zapi hae balyn kha hythua a pya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah, pawccecize ka paaw David kyakhe a mung te byakinpakuh zah, <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha Izip ram kyate ka poukhae nin hae kyate tho zah, ka min a umnaw lanpaw inn kha sak nawlan, Israel phin hae kya-e pawpaw khua kha mah ka po khyh; thuasalama ka ccungccaw Israel hae a uktu lang David kha ka po,’ cite a hopaw kha a kuih te a ccingsah vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:4-11">2Sa 7.4-11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:3-10">1Sh 17.3-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min hanlan inn sak lanpaw kha ka paaw David thinlung kya a la um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-3">2Sa 7.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-2">1Sh 17.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka paaw David kha, ‘Ka min hanlan inn sak lan na tuaku keiccuze ahoypaw kha na cyi vae; <verse number="19" style="v" />thuasalama nang nynh inn kha na sak lan khyh, na saahkuh cih paw na ccapaw nynh ka min hanlan inn kha a sak cih,’ a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2Sa 7.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-12">1Sh 17.11-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinkupaw kha a ccingsah vae; pawccecize ka paaw David umnaw kya ka um vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinku thyhte, Israel bawitungkhung kya ka haung zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min hanlan inn kha ka sak vae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ah minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin ryte a raepaw a byakinnaw a umnahpaw thingkua elang hmin kha ka paccyn vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2Sh 6.12-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang malang, Israel zapi hae balyn muihnaw khe thadyn zah, vaawlang khe a kuih kha daw zah, <verse number="23" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, ahangnaw vaawram te anenaw laephi kya nang ae lopaw Pachia um khyh, mih thinlung balynte namaw malang a cceih hae paw na ryalahtu hae hanlan byakinnaw te atynpaw sungsahnaw kha na langsah vae, <verse number="24" style="v" />na ryalahtu ka paaw David hanlan na tynsahpaw byakinnaw kha na hopya thyhte na zui; na mung te bya na kinpakuh zah na kuih te atunin na ccingsah vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, na ryalahtu ka paaw David kyaze, ‘Nang nynh ka malang na ccia hawte, na ccaaw hae nynh ka malang ccia lan mih laanpi kha a raeringku hae zetuh, Israel bawitungkhung kya kamaw malang a haung cih paw na ciihan tuh dae lan khyh,’ cite na kinpyakupaw bya kha beih tynsah tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1Si 2.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou Israel Pachia, na ryalahtu ka paaw David kya na kinpyakupaw na bya kha beih tynsah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Thuasalama Pachia tuh laephi vawlan um ccaccing vema? Vaawram te ahang huaccepaw vaawram nynh heize nang kha ae ccawng khyh, kae nynh ka sakpaw e inn thathy tuh hosyn um vae khyh!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:6">2Sh 2.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, na ryalahtupaw nynh saw ka sangpaw te kae ngiapaw hynh yn ngaepya tua, na ryalahtupaw nynh atunin namaw malang ka siapaw te saw ka sangpaw hynh yn thaepya tua; <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Hein kya ka min a um cih,’ na cinaw hmin, e inn kalan hin khuazi khuadae yn do lah, na ryalahtupaw nynh hynh-e hmin kalan hawite saw ka sangpaw hynh beih yn thaepya tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Deu 12.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw te na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh e hmin kalan hawite saw kae sang vae ze, kae ngiapaw kha yn thaepya tua; na umnaw vaawram te yn thaepah lah, kae seinaw kha oun ngaethya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Lukhakheit nynh a innpaw tungvaw a sei keiccuze thyalawsaku thua zah, e inn kya na silawhang malang poute thya a lawku ze, <verse number="32" style="v" />nang nynh vaawram te thae lah, rya yn lah lah, na ryalahtu hae hynh bya oun piatua, a seitupaw tuh a cyisahnaw kha amaw lu vawlan ccah sah lah, a dingpaw tuh a dingnaw thyhte thanenaw pya khylan thyaccousah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh na tungvaw a sei hae keiccuze mih rhaw hae malang he a shung hae te, namaw kalan bua oun maekuh hae zah na min kha sawtuate, e inn kyahin namaw kalan sawsangte ae ngiaku hae ze, <verse number="34" style="v" />vaawram te thaepah hae lah, na ccungccaw Israel hae seinaw kha ngaethya hae, te mih minpaaw hae na pya hae paw ram langkhe bua kikhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Na tungvaw a sei hae keiccuze vaaw kha na khawsung zah khuaa kansah te de he na tah hae te, minmin nynh e hmin kalan hawite sawsang hae zah, na min kha sawtuate, mih seinaw kyate a maeleihku hae ze, <verse number="36" style="v" />vaawram te la thae lah, na ryalahtu hae te na ccungccaw Israel hae seinaw kha ngaethya hae; a zui lan hae paw laanpi hoypaw kha ccangpah hae lah, na ccungccaw hae elang rho lang na pya hae paw na ram kya khuaarawsah tua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Ram lungkhu kya ccakan acci ze thuasah, shethya a thua ze thuasah, looh aphi poute ronaw, khivae keiccu looh ronaw, tungkhipaw te khung-angroh keiccu looh ronaw thuasah, rhaw nynh mih khua khuakhakheit kha a koihku ze thuasah, shethya ccangkhakheit, ccinaw ccangkhakheit a um ze thuasah, <verse number="38" style="v" />na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh mih balynte thuasah, humhung nynh mah lukhakheit te thuasah mih thinlung raveih kya a teing hae paw kha nykute, e inn kalan hin mih kuih dawte pawpaw sawsangnaw thuasah, pawpaw ngianaw thuasah oun rae hae ze, <verse number="39" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram te la thaepah hae, mih seinaw ngaethya hae lah bawmtua hae, mih thinlung na ny hae paw balyn kha a zui hae paw mih laanpi thyhte pyaru hae, pawccecize ccungccaw miakaw thinlung kya pawmou a um cipaw kha nang rou nynh na nyh; <verse number="40" style="v" />tuhteze nynh kae minpaaw hae na la pya hae paw ram kya um hae zah a hiin lungkhu hae balyn nang kha ae rih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Tuhawte, na ccungccaw Israel athua leipaw ramccangpaw nynh alesaepaw na min, athungpaw na kuih te na dyngpaw na kuih konglang kha a thae keiccuze na min liate laansawpi te yn thua zah, <verse number="42" style="v" />tuh-e ramccangpaw nynh e inn kalan hawite saw a sang ze, <verse number="43" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram te thaepah lah, ramccangpaw nynh ae ngiapaw balyn thyhte cyipya tua; tuhteze nynh laephi ccungccaw balyn nynh na ccungccaw Israel hae hawte na min kha a nyh cih hae zah nang kha ae rih cih hae; te ka sakpaw e inn kyahin na min kha ko athua cipaw a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />“Na ccungccaw hae nynh mih rhaw hae kha tuk khylan a ccia vae hae ze, pawpaw laanpi na zuisah hae zemah, na popaw khua kalan te na min hanlan ka sakpaw inn kalan hawite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sang hae ze, <verse number="45" style="v" />mih sawsangnaw te mih ngiakunaw kha vaawram te thaepah hae lah, mih ryalaw kya pankhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“A sei leipaw lu kheit san a um khyh keiccuze—minmin nynh na tungvaw sei hae zah minmin elang na thinria keiccuze rhaw hae kuih kalan na pya hae zah minmin kha asawnaw khyhze anaenaw umpaw mih rhaw hae ram lang kyngte cciakhae athua hae ze thuasah, <verse number="47" style="v" />a cciakhaenaw hae ram kyakhe minmin nynh mih thinlung kya oun nyhthui hae zah ngaesikute a kyngtu hae ram kyakhe nang kha, ‘Kae sei vae, kae cyisei vae, ahoy leipaw rya kae lawsei vae,’ cite ae ngiaku hae ze thuasah, <verse number="48" style="v" />kyngte a cciakhaetu hae mih rhaw hae ram kyakhe mih thinlung te mih tuanaw balyn te ngaesikuh hae zah, mih minpaaw hae na pya hae paw mih ram, na popaw khua te na min hanlan ka sakpaw inn kalan hawite namaw kalan saw oun sang hae ze thuasah, <verse number="49" style="v" />na umnaw vaawram kyate mih sawsangnaw te mih ngiakunaw kha thaepah hae, mih ryalaw kya pankhae hae lah, <verse number="50" style="v" />na tungvaw a sei hae paw na ccungccaw hae kha ngaethya hae lah, na tungvaw a cyiseinaw hae balyn kha ngaethya hae; minmin kha kyngte a cciakhaetu hae nynh mih tungvaw ngaethya a umsah nawlan hae, a cciakhaetu hae kya ngaethyaumsahnaw thinlung kha hoisah hae, <verse number="51" style="v" />(pawccecize minmin tuh sivaw somaee laku, Izip ram kyate na poukhae hae paw na ccungccaw hae te na rho nynh thua hae). <verse number="52" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw nynh kae ngianaw te na ccungccaw Israel hae nynh ae ngianaw hae kalan hin na mit kha beih dotua, minmin nynh ae ko takyh hae te beih ngaepah hae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Pawccecize pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kae minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate na poukhae lya hae ze, na ryalahtu Moses kyate bya na kinpyaku hae thyhte, Israel hae kha namaw rho lang tang khylan, laephi ccungccaw hae balyn laku kyate minmin kha na phia vae hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Zapi hae Hythuapya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hynh-e sawsangnaw te ngianaw balyn kha he a thangsah tuh, a ccukharutungte vaawlang khe a kuih a dawnaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang malang te a thokuh; <verse number="55" style="v" />te thadyn zah Israel zapi hae balyn kha roi myarya ccae lante hythua a pya hae:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Bya a kinkupaw balyn thyhte a ccungccaw Israel hae kha daenaw a pyatu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh thehoysah oh; a ryalahtu Moses kyate a hopaw a byakin hoypaw balyn kha ccangkheit san roh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:10">Deu 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 21:44-45">Jos 21.44-45</ref></char></note> <verse number="57" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia tuh ah minpaaw hae kya a um hawte, aening kya mah um vae sah; aning nynh aening hynh oun cciataw nan sah lah, oun vua nan sah, <verse number="58" style="v" />a laanpi hae balyn kha ah zui nawlan oh thuasah, aning nynh ah minpaaw hae kaw a la pya hae paw a kawbya hae, a phungbya hae te a phungzae hae kha ah zui nawlan oh thuasah ah thinlung kha amaw kalan oun mae vae sah. <verse number="59" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang ka ngianawpaw ka bya hae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia pe khe khuazi khuadae um vae sah; a ryalahtupaw kae ka ryalaw te a ccungccaw Israel hae ryalaw hynh nin takyh aho thyhte oun pankhae vae sah; <verse number="60" style="v" />tuhteze nynh laephi ccungccaw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia thua zah ccangpaw Pachia um khyh cipaw a nyh cih hae. <verse number="61" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a kawbya hae te a phungbya hae kha zuite, atunin na cyi oh hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kalan nae thinlung kha khaleih pyakuh oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon nynh Silawnaw A Rae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2Sh 7.4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Te siapharan te a kya umpaw Israel hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="63" style="v" />Solomon nynh tangnuapaw thong kuin lae ning te tuu cciing kheit thong kuin khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae. Tuhcite siapharan te Israel ccungccaw hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha a ap hae. <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuin nin khe siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn malang a umpaw voidu angaelung kha a thyaasah; pawccecize tuin kyakhe maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnawpaw kya-e satho kha a pya, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang umpaw sohin silawhang tuh maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnawpaw kya-e satho kha pya nawlan myaryamaw adi keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon te a kya umpaw Israel hae balyn, Lebo-hamath khua kyate Izip Vaw kyacia um hae paw myarya lungpaw zapi hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia malang khe nin sari lungkhu poi a tua hae. <verse number="66" style="v" />Nin taryanaw nin khe ccungccaw hae kha a cciasah hae; minmin nynh siapharan kha hythuapya hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu David te a ccungccaw Israel hae tungvaw a langsahkupaw hoynaw balyn keiccuze lungtua lungpawte mih inn raveih lang a ki hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon kya Pachia Bua A Langkuh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2Sh 7.11-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, siapharan inn te Solomon nynh sak a rypaw balyn kha he a sak koute, <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeon khua kya a langpyaku hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Solomon kalan vae ningnaw a langkuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">1Si 3.5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 1:7">2Sh 1.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha, “Ka malang saw na sangpaw te nae ngiapaw kha ka thae vae; na sakpaw hynh-e inn hynh ka thyaasah vae zah, a lungkhu kya ka min kha zungzae ka nung vae; ka mit te ka thinlung tuh tuin kya tyty a um cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Na paaw David nynh a la ccia hawte, nang nynh accingpaw thinlung te dingnaw te ka malang na cceih zah, kaw kae pyapaw balyn thyhte na cyi zah ka phungbya hae te ka phungzae hae kha na zui zetuh, <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Israel bawitungkhung kya a haung cih paw na ciihan tuh dae lan khyh,’ cite na paaw David kha bya ka kinpyaku hawte, Israel hae kya na siapharan bawitungkhung tuh zungzae ka tynsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">1Si 2.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Namaw thuasah, na ccaaw hae thuasah kae kha zui leite na cceihsei oh zah, nae malang ka nungpaw ka kawbya hae te ka phungbya hae kha zui leite, ccangpaw pachia hae kalan cciate ryalawpyate na beik oh zetuh, <verse number="7" style="v" />ka pya hae paw ram kyate Israel hae kha ka vua cih hae; ka min hanlan ka thyaasahpaw inn hynh ka muihnaw kyate ka vua cih; Israel tuh ccungccaw hae balyn kya phungtangbya te saryapaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />E inn hynh arohpaw apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih; a pe po a cceih hae paw miakaw nynh mih ngaeangthuate saryanaw roi a sawnua cih hae zah, ‘E ram te e inn hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh pawccemou hynhte a cyi?’ cite a ho cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">2Si 25.9</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:19">2Sh 36.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, ‘Mih minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha vua hae zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha doliakute beik hae zah rya a lawpya hae keiccu nynh thua; tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ronaw hynh mih tungvaw a thuasah,’ cite a ho cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon nynh inn innning, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kha sak zah kum kuin he aro te, <verse number="11" style="v" />Tair Siapharan Hiram nynh Solomon kha sidar thing, maeccaw thing te sui kha a ry zeihte a la pya keiccuze Solomon Siapharan nynh Hiram kha Galilee ram e khua khuakuin a pya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama Solomon nynh a pyapaw ram kha do khylan Hiram nynh Tair kyate cceih zah he a do tuh, a lungryccing khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning nynh, “Ka unopaw, nae pyapaw hynh-e khua hae hynh pawcihawpaw khua hae mou athua hae?” a cipya. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hae tuh atunin cia Kabul ram a ci hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiram nynh siapharan kha sui talent za kheit ccangkuin a pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Solomon Ryalaw hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2Sh 8.3-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te amaw inn kha sak khylan te Millo khua, Jerusalem khualungrua, Hazor khua, Megiddo khua te Gezer khua kha rae khylan nangsete rya a lawsah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />(Izip siapharan Faro nynh Gezer khua kha tuk zah a lah koute maee te a soi, khua kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha a chia hae, te Solomon zu lang a tangpaw a ccanung kha tuh-e khua tuh a thosakhaeku; <verse number="17" style="v" />tukeiccuze Solomon nynh Gezer khua kha a raethui), Alia Beth-horon, <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalath khua, Judah ram lungkhu ramkaw umpaw Tamar khua, <verse number="19" style="v" />Solomon nynh a hoipaw uccaw a ccakhungnawpaw khua hae, a marangle hae elang khua hae, a marang rhawkaw hae elang khua hae te Jerusalem kya, Lebanon kya te a ukpaw ram hae balyn kyakhe Solomon nynh a rae rypaw khua miakaw kha a rae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Amor hae, Hit hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae lungkhu e a laehypaw ccungccaw hae, Israel hae athua lei hae paw— <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel hae nynh khaleih a ro kho lei hae paw, ram lungkhu kya a laehy hae paw mih ciihan hae kha Solomon nynh nangsete see lang a mang hae, tukeiccuze atunin cia a um hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomon nynh Israel hae kha tuh see lang mang khyh hae; minmin tuh rhawkaw hae, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, a rhawbawi hae, a rhawkaw uktu hae, a marangle bawi hae te marang rhawkaw hae lang a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon rya a lahtu hae kha a dopahtu lupi hae, za pangaw sung pangaw a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Faro ccanung tuh David khua kyate Solomon nynh a sakpyapaw amaw inn langkhe a cceih; tukoute Solomon nynh Millo khua kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang a raepaw silawhang kyakhe maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha kum kheit ze vae thum leih rae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang mynkhuhpaw kha leih a u. Tuhcite inn tuh a lyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:17">Exo 23.17</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:23">34.23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:16">Deu 16.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh Edom ram kya, Rili Se kin e Eloth khua pe umpaw Eziongeber khua kyakhe sanphalung phu kheit kha a rae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Hiram nynh a ryalahtu hae, rili kong a nyhthya hae paw sanphalung kya ryalahtu hae kha Solomon a ryalahtu hae ryte a sawkheih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Ofir lang cceih hae zah tuin kya-e sui talent za pali ccangkuin kha Solomon Siapharan kalan oun phu hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sheba Siapharannung nynh Paebuanaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Sh 9.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon a minthaannaw kha he a thae tuh, (<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min keiccuze a minthaan), myarya rupaw byakhianaw khate syntawtua lan yn cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12.42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:31">Luk 11.31</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />A mikung hae patae ryte amynkhuhpaw hae, sui patae te aphutepaw lung hae a phupaw kalauh hae ryte Jerusalem lang yn cceih; Solomon kya he a thua te, a thinlung kya umpaw miakaw kha a hopya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Bya a khiapaw miakaw kha Solomon nynh a khungru; siapharan nynh a ny leipaw, a ccaesahpya kho leipaw pawpaw mah um khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon a hawnaw, a sakpaw inn, <verse number="5" style="v" />a ccaboi vawlan e looh, a kuihkaw e bawi hae mih umtuzia, a ryalahtu hae ryalaw dopyanaw, mih boeining, a ryalahtu pise hae te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya maee-ute si a lawnaw kha he a muih tuh, a ngaeangthua zah a lung phe mua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te aning nynh siapharan kha, “Ka ram kyate ka thaepaw na ryalaw konglang te na hawnaw kong tuh akyh, <verse number="7" style="v" />thuasalama kamaw po kae thua zah ka mit te ka muih mawlaezung tuh a ho hae paw kha ka la zyn khyh. Angankuh sanmah yn la hopah khyh hae; na hawnaw te na hoirumnaw tuh ka la thaepaw kha po a lawe. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na zu hae tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua hae! Nang kha palei ae oihsah hae zah na hawnaw palei a thae hae paw na ryalahtu hae tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua hae! <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tungvaw a lungrythua zah Israel bawitungkhung kya ae nungpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha zungzae a sungsah keiccuze nang nynh byading te dingnaw kha na rae nawlan siapharan lang ae khang vae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon kha sui talent za kheit ccangkuin, amynkhuhpaw patae te aphutepaw lung hae kha a pya; Sheba siapharannung nynh Solomon Siapharan a pyapaw zeih alung lante amynkhuhpaw kha bua yn thua boi vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, Ofir khua kyate sui oun phupaw Hiram sanphalung hae phu nynh Ofir khua kyate almuk thing patae te aphutepaw lung hae kha oun phu hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Siapharan nynh tuh-e almuk thing khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn dounawpaw tung hae, siapharan inn dounawpaw tung hae te hlawsahthya hae paw elang tang-oi te tintang hae kha mah a rae hae; tuhcihawpaw almuk thing tuh thua boi vae khyh zah, atunin cia muih boi um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh lungthote a pyapaw lasung holeite, Sheba siapharannung nynh ry zah a ngiakupaw miakaw kha mah a pya. Tukoute siapharannung tuh a ryalahtu hae ryte amaw ram lang a ki vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomon kalan kum kheit ze a teepaw sui nynh aripaw tuh talent za taruh sung taruh ccangtaruh acih. <verse number="15" style="v" />E hae hynh kungku hae, uccaw zuatu hae, Arabia siapharan hae balyn te ram uktu bawi hae kyate a teepaw laelan nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomon nynh sui khawriaphua alepaw za ning kha rae zah, tuh-e khawriaphua ccangkheit cci elang deihpaw sui shekel za taruh cci athang. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh deihpaw sui te khawriaphua za thum kha rae zah, tuh-e ccangkheit cci elang sui mina ccangthum cci athang; tuh-e hae tuh siapharan nynh Lebanon Tuhpi Inn kya a nung hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Siapharan nynh saepanua te bawitungkhung lepaw kha mah rae zah, sui ccite a thei. <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawitungkhung tuh kaenawpaw thyh taruh a um. Bawitungkhung adung anulang tuh apyng, haungnaw voilang ranglang te kuih khangnawpaw um zah, tuh-e kuih khangnawpaw pe tuin chindeih sa ning a thadyn hae, <verse number="20" style="v" />te kaenawpaw thyh taruh vawlan akin lang voilang ranglang khe chindeih sa kheit ccite sa haw lae ning a thadyn hae. Tuhcihawpaw bawitungkhung tuh teitei ram kya mah rae boi khyh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh a nianawpaw banang balyn tuh sui thua zah, Lebanon Tuhpi Inn kya-e angphe hae balyn tuh sui ccite raepaw nynh thua hae; ccangkheit sanmah ngun um khyh, Solomon she lya tuh ngun hynh pawlangria khyh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Hiram kya-e sanphalung phu ryte rili kya a cceih bungthung hae paw Tarshish sanphalung phu phukheit a hoi. Tarshish sanphalung phu tuh kum thum ze vae kheit leih oun thua hae zah, sui, ngun, saepanua, zuapaw hae te buatua hae kha leih oun phu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon Siapharan nynh laephi vaw e siapharan hae balyn kha hoirumnaw te hawnaw kya pong a lawe hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pachia nynh Solomon thinlung kya a pyapaw hawnaw kha thae khylan, laephi pynpi nynh amaw kalan oun ccia hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e hae miakaw nynh sui te ngun uccaw hae, boeining hae, zunghe hae, amynkhuhpaw hae, marang hae te lann hae kha kum takyh lasung lang a ccyngpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon nynh marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae kha a pum hae; aning nynh marangle thong kheit za pali te marang rhawkaw thong haw lae ning kha hoi zah, tuh-e hae tuh marangle khua hae kya te Jerusalem khua siapharan kyakhe a nung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:26">1Si 4.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Jerusalem khua khe ngun kha lung zeih lungsah zah, sidar thing kha Shefelah kya umpaw thaeku ku zeih a lungsah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Solomon nynh a repaw marang hae tuh Izip te Kue kya-e nynh thua; siapharan a kungkutu hae nynh amee pyate Kue kya-e kha leih a re hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Deu 17.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Izip ram kya-e marangle ccangkheit kha ngun shekel za taruh te, marang sa kheit kha za kheit sung pangaw te re kho athua; tuhcite Hit siapharan hae te Siria siapharan hae balyn kalan khe siapharan a kungkutu hae kyate a zua pathy hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon A Cyiseinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon Siapharan nynh ramccang nopi patae kha a ry: Faro ccanung, Moab hae, Ammon hae, Edom hae, Sidon hae te Hit hae kya-e nopi hae kha a ry hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Deu 17.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae kha, “Nanning nynh ramccang hae kha zuvaw lang na umkhae lan khyh oh, minmin nynh mah zuvaw lang ae umkhae nan oh sah; pawccecize minmin nynh nae thinlung kha mih pachia hae kalan solei ae maekhaekuh cih oh,” cite a la hopya hae paw minphuin hae kya-e nopi hae kha Solomon nynh ry hae zah a sungsah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Exo 34.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:3-4">Deu 7.3-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawi ccanung athua hae paw zu za sari te lovae za thum kha a hoi; a zu hae nynh a thinlung kha ccanglang a maesaku hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Solomon he a taw tuh, a zu hae nynh a thinlung kha ccangpaw pachia hae kalan a maesaku hae; a paaw David thinlung hawte thua leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia tungvaw kya a lungtyn khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize Solomon nynh Sidon hae khozinung Astartes te Ammon hae pachia anungsikuhpaw Milkom kha a zui hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahoy leipaw kha rae zah, a paaw David nynh a cyi hawte cyi leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinlung balynte zui khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomon nynh Jerusalem nithua lang e mua vawlan khe Moab hae khozi anungsikuhpaw Khemosh hanlan te Ammon hae pachia anungsikuhpaw Molek hanlan ahangpaw hmin kha a rae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhmaminte ramccang ccungccaw a zu hae balyn hanlan raepah hae zah, minmin nynh mih pachia hae kalan mynkhuhpaw u hae zah si a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Solomon tungvaw a thinria, pawccecize amaw kalan vae ning yn langkuh zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />ccangpaw pachia hae kha na zui lan khyh cite kaw a pyatupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kyate a thinlung tuh ccanglang maekuh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pyapaw kha zui khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Solomon kha, “E hynh na thinlung kya um zah, kaw kae pyapaw ka byakinnaw te ka phungbya hae kha na zui khyh keiccuze na kyate peenaw hynh ka lah ccaccing cih zah na ryalahtupaw kalan ka pya cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama na paaw David keiccuze tuh-e tuh na she lungkhu kya ka cyih lan khyh, na ccapaw kuih kyate ram hynh ka lah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhzemah ram hynh abalynte ka lah lan khyh, ka ryalahtu David te ka popaw Jerusalem khua keiccuze minphuin phuin kheit kha na ccapaw kalan ka pya cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Rhaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Solomon a rawsepaw Edom ccungccaw Hadad kha a tuhou; aning tuh Edom ram kya bawi phin nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize David nynh Edom ram a um lyaze a rhawbawipaw Joab nynh a chih hae paw rhua uu khylan he a cceih tuh, Edom ram e pise miakaw kha a chia hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />(pawccecize Joab te Israel hae balyn tuh Edom ram e pise miakaw a chia mawlaezung hae tuin kya sah taruh a um hae); <verse number="17" style="v" />thuasalama Hadad tuh a di lyaze a paaw ryalahtu Edom hae abang ryte Izip ram lang a la ccue hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian ram kyate pou hae zah Paran ram a thua hae; Paran kyate ccungccaw abang hoeikute Izip siapharan Faro kya a thua hae; aning nynh inn te looh kha pya zah laephi kha mah a pya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadad nynh Faro kha myarya a lung a tung; tukeiccuze a zu Tahpenes a neitawnung kha zu lang a pya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahpenes neitawnung nynh ccapaw Genubath kha saah zah, imua tuh Faro inn kyakhe Tahpenes nynh mateitui a phia; Genubath tuh Faro ccaaw hae ryte Faro inn kya a umkheih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />David tuh a minpaaw hae kya ihbua vae zah rhawbawipaw Joab tuh a chih vae cipaw kha Hadad nynh he a thae tuh, Hadad nynh Faro kha, “Kamaw ram lang kinaw kaw beih yn pya,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Faro nynh, “Namaw ram lang ki ry lan ciate ka kya ahoboupaw pawmou a um?” cite khia zah, Hadad nynh, “Um khyh, kinaw kaw beih yn pya,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia nynh Solomon a rawsetu lang mingccangpaw, Eliada ccapaw Rezon kha a tuhou, aning tuh a bawipaw Zobah siapharan Hadadezer kyate a ccuepaw nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />David nynh Zobah khuapaw kha a theih koute, aning nynh zuitu hae kha amaw kalan pum hae zah, luadetu phu kya lu lang a tang; minmin tuh Damaskas khua lang cceih hae zah tuin kya a um hae, te amaw kha Damaskas khua kya siapharan lang a khang hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomon she balyn kya Rezon tuh Israel rhaw lang tang zah, Hadad nynh a cyi hawte vawsawnaw kha a rae; Siria ram kha uk zah Israel kha a hua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam nynh Rawsenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomon ryalahtu lu kheit, Efraim phin, Zeredah khuapaw, Nebah ccapaw Jeroboam nynh mah siapharan kha a dou, a nung tuh Zeruah cikuhpaw nomaenung nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh siapharan a rawsenaw kong tuh akawlan thyhte nynh thua. Solomon nynh Millo khua kha rae zah, a paaw David khua kya-e khualungrua a uanaw kha a ping. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboam tuh rya a lah khopaw nynh thua, ryalaw a zuakuhpaw ccangvae nynh thua cipaw kha Solomon nynh he a muih tuh, Josef ciihan hae nynh a law hae paw nangsepaw ryalaw balyn kyakhe a do-oihtu lang a nung. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuh lya loukaw khe, Jeroboam tuh Jerusalem lang a ccia lyakhe Shilon khuapaw profeh Ahijah nynh laanpi kya a muih. Ahijah tuh boeining thawpaw a lawkuh. Mih lu ning kyalya te ramkaw a um lya hae khe, <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahijah nynh a lawkupaw boeining thawpaw kha kyng zah ccanghaw lae ning lang a seii. <verse number="31" style="v" />Aning nynh Jeroboam kha: E aseiikuhpaw ccanghaw hynh lawkuh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh, “Dotua, peenaw hynh Solomon kuih kyate ka seii cih zah, minphuin phuin haw kha nang kae pya cih. <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu David te Israel phin hae balyn kyate ka popaw Jerusalem khua keiccuze phin phinkheit hynh tuh Solomon nynh a ccou cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha yn vua zah Sidon hae khozinung Astartes, Moab hae pachia Khemosh te Ammon hae pachia Milkom kha beik zah ka laanpi kha zui khyh, a paaw David nynh ka muihnaw kya ahmepaw a cyi hawte aning nynh cyi khyh zah, ka phungbya hae te ka phungzae hae kha a paaw nynh a zui hawte zui khyh. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhzemah a kuih kyate peenaw kha abalynte ka lah lan khyh; ka po zah ka kawbya hae te ka phungbya hae a zuipaw ka ryalahtu David keiccuze Solomon tuh a she lungkhu balyn uktu lang ka nung cih; <verse number="35" style="v" />thuasalama a ccapaw kuih kyate peenaw kha ka lah cih zah nang kha kae pya cih—minphuin phuin haw kha kae pya cih. <verse number="36" style="v" />Thuasalama ka min nung nawlan ka popaw Jerusalem khua kya ka malang khe ka ryalahtu David nynh maeekhua zungzae a hoi nawlan, a ccapaw kha minphuin phuin kheit ka pya cih. <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang kha kae po cih zah na rypaw balyn kha na uk cih; nang tuh Israel hae a uktu siapharan lang na tang cih. <verse number="38" style="v" />Nang nynh kaw kae pyapaw balyn kha na ngae zah, ka ryalahtu David hawte ka laanpi kya zuite, ka phungbya hae te ka kawbya hae kha na zui zah ka muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha na cyi zetuh, na kya ka um cih zah David elang ka sak hawte atynpaw inn kae sakpah cih zah Israel kha kae pya cih. <verse number="39" style="v" />E keiccuze David ciihan hae kha de ka tah cih hae, thuasalama zungzae tuh thua lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Solomon nynh Jeroboam kha chia lan a zuaku; thuasalama Jeroboam tuh Izip ram lang, Izip siapharan Shishak kalan palou ccue zah Solomon a chi mawlaezung Izip ram kya a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2Sh 9.29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomon nynh a cyipaw tuhlaepaw balyn te a hawnaw tuh Solomon Ryalawnaw Ccauh kyakhe a zei hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Solomon nynh Jerusalem khua kya um zah Israel ram balyn kha kum sung pali a uk. <verse number="43" style="v" />Solomon tuh a minpaaw hae kya ihbua zah a paaw David khua kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Rehoboam tuh amaw koute siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thahlang e Minphuin hae Phiakunaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2Sh 10.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae balyn nynh Rehoboam kha siapharan lang khang khylan Shekhem khua lang a ccia hae keiccuze amaw mah Shekhem khua lang a cceih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh he a thae tuh (pawccecize aning tuh Solomon Siapharan kyate a ccuenaw Izip ram kya nynh a um ung), Jeroboam tuh Izip ram kyate yn ki. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel hae nynh amaw kha a kosah hae; te Jeroboam te Israel zapi balyn nynh oun cceih hae zah Rehoboam kha, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw kha oun phusah vae. Tukeiccuze na paaw nynh kae tungvaw rya rupaw te phupaw ripaw oun phusahpaw hynh nang nynh oun zawsahpah lah, na rya kae lawpah cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “La cceih oh lah, nin thum koute ka kalan bua nae cceih cih oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Rehoboam Siapharan nynh a paaw Solomon a hiin lyaze a do-oih hae paw piccan hae kha tuanaw ngia hae zah, “E ccungccaw hae kalan khungru lanpaw bya hynh pawtemou tuanaw nae pya cih oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh amaw kha, “Atunin hynh-e ccungccaw hae hanlan ryalahtu na thua zah minmin hanlan rya na lah zah bya he na khungru hae te, bya hoypaw te na khung hae zetuh, minmin tuh na ryalahtu lang zungzae a tang cih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama piccan hae nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha pawlangria khyh, amaw te ruibankheih thua hae zah amaw a do-oih hae paw ccangvae hae kha tuanaw a ngia hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “ ‘Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw oun phusahpaw hynh oun zawsahpya tua,’ cite oun hopah hae paw e ccungccaw hae khungru lanpaw hynh pawtemou tuanaw nae pya cih oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruibankheih athua hae paw ccangvae hae nynh amaw kha, “ ‘Na paaw nynh phupaw ripaw oun phusahpaw hynh nang nynh oun zawsahpya tua,’ cite ae hopah hae paw e ccungccaw hae hynh hynhte na khung cih hae; minmin kha, ‘Ka kuihdung taraw hynh ka paaw tae laeze athaawhua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka paaw nynh phupaw ripaw ae phusah oh, kae nynh nae phupaw kha houh ka buchih cih. Ka paaw nynh ccungngue te ae thuihei oh, kae nynh tuh zekang te kae thuihei cih oh,’ cite na cipah cih hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh, “Nin thumnaw nin kya ka kalan bua nae cceih cih oh,” cite a ho thyhte, Jeroboam te ccungccaw balyn tuh nin thumnaw nin khe Rehoboam kalan oun thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw hae kha bya repaw te a khung hae. Piccan hae nynh tuanaw a pya hae paw kha pawlangria leite <verse number="14" style="v" />ccangvae hae nynh a pya hae paw tuanaw thyhte minmin kha, “Ka paaw nynh phupaw ripaw ae phusah oh, kae nynh nae phupaw kha houh ka buchih cih; ka paaw nynh ccungngue te ae thuihei oh, kae nynh tuh zekang te kae thuihei cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Siapharan nynh ccungccaw hae bya kha ngae khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Shilon khuapaw Ahijah kha mangte Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam kya a hopaw bya kha ccingsah khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ry keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kae bya hynh ngae khyh cipaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh he a muih hae tuh, ccungccaw hae nynh siapharan kha,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kaening nynh David kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoupaw pawmou kae hoi?</para>
  <para style="q1">Jesse ccapaw kya rho kae hoi khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Israel, nae bu kalan cceih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou David, namaw maw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na innbyn kha do-oihku tua,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite a khung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:1">2Sa 20.1</ref></char></note> Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh mih bu raveih lang a ki hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama Rehoboam nynh Judah khua hae kya umpaw Israel hae kha a uk hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangsete ryalawsahnaw kyaze uktu bawi athuapaw Adoram kha Rehoboam Siapharan nynh saw zah, Israel hae balyn nynh lung te phe chih lan a deih hae. Rehoboam Siapharan tuh Jerusalem lang ccue khylan a marangle kya arangte a ccikuh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae nynh David ciihan kha atunin cia a dou hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam yn ki vae cipaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, ccungccaw sawte zapi pumkunaw kalan kosah hae zah Israel balyn a uktu siapharan lang a khang hae. Judah phin laelan, David ciihan a zuipaw hum sanmah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh Jerusalem khua he a thua te, Israel hae kha rhawtuk lan zah peenaw kha Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam kalan bua pyathui khylan, Judah phin balyn te Benjamin phin kya-e popaw rhawkaw cciing kheit thong sung tarya kha a pum hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia bya tuh Pachia ccungccapaw Shemaiah kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomon ccapaw, Judah siapharan Rehoboam te Judah phin te Benjamin phin balyn te tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kyakhe, <verse number="24" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae uno Israel hae kha tuk khylan ccianua thung nan oh. Nae balynte nae inn lang ki oh, pawccecize e hynh kamaw kyate yn thuapaw nynh thua, a ci cite hopah hae,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte mih inn lang bua a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam kya-e Sui Vaetuataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Jeroboam nynh Efraim muaram khe Shekhem khua kha rae zah tuin kya a um; te tuin kyate pou zah Penuel khua kha mah a rae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Jeroboam nynh a thinlung kyakhe, “Atu tuh peenaw hynh David ciihan kalan a kithui mamin cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae nynh Jerusalem khua umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kyakhe silawnaw rae lan a ccia hae zetuh, e ccungccaw hae thinlung hynh mih bawipaw, Judah siapharan Rehoboam kalan bua a paleihkuh cih; kae hynh yn theih cih hae zah Judah siapharan Rehoboam kalan a ki cih hae,” cite a tua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh tuanaw ngia hae zah sui vaetuataw ccangning kha a rae. Aning nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Jerusalem lang palei na cciathung oh paw hynh azaw vae. Pou Israel hae, Izip ram kyate ae poukhae oh paw nae pachia hae hynh dotua oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4">Exo 32.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Ccangkheit kha Bethel khua kya nung zah ccangpaw ccangkheit kha Dan khua kya a nung. <verse number="30" style="v" />E uccaw hynh seinaw lang a tang, pawccecize ccungccaw hae nynh Bethel kya umpaw sui vaetuataw ccangkheit kalan te Dan kya umpaw ccangpaw ccangkheit kalan cia beik lan a ccianua hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh ahangnaw hmin khe inn hae kha sak zah ccungccaw balyn kya-e Levi phin athua leipaw kha ranpibawi lang a khang hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh Judah ram kya tuapaw poi hawte, sawpaw sah taryanaw nin haw lae pangaw nin khe poi tua zah silawhang kyakhe si a law; tuhcite Bethel kya cyih zah, a raepaw sui vaetuataw hae kha si a law. A raepaw hmin hangpaw hae elang a khang hae paw ranpibawi hae kha Bethel kya a nung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32-33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-34">Lev 23.33-34</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Amaw makhaete a khyakupaw sawpaw sah taryanaw nin haw lae pangaw nin khe Bethel khua umpaw, amaw nynh a raepaw silawhang kalan khe a cceihthung; Israel hae elang poi ccangkheit tua zah mynkhuhpaw u khylan silawhang kalan a cceihthung.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Ram e Pachia Ccungccapaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboam tuh mynkhuhpaw u khylan silawhang pe a thadyn lyakhe, Pachia ccungccapaw lu kheit tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte Judah ram kyate Bethel khua yn thua zah, <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte silawhang kha sianua zah, “Pou silawhang, silawhang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: ‘David ciihan kyate a min Josiah cikuhpaw ccapaw lu kheit yn pui cih; nang na vawlan mynkhuhpaw u hae zah hmin hangpaw kya ranpibawi rya a lah hae paw kha tuh-e ccungccapaw nynh nang na vawlan khe si a lawnah cih hae zah, ccungccaw ru hae tuh na vawlan khe u athua cih hae,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15-16">2Si 23.15-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin nin khe muihsahnaw ccangkheit pya zah, “E hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw muihsahnaw nynh thua; ‘Silawhang tuh a koi cih zah a vawlan umpaw buhhaw tuh alaekuh cih,’ a ci,” cite a ho. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh Bethel khua kya silawhang a sianuapaw bya kha Jeroboam siapharan nynh he a thae tuh, silawhang kyate a kuih kha dyng zah, “Khah-e paw kha kyng oh!” a ci. Te a dyngpaw a kuih tuh karae rou zah khin kho vae khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh Pachia ccungccapaw a pyapaw muihsahnaw thyhte, silawhang tuh mah koi zah silawhang kyate buhhaw tuh alaekuh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kha, “Ka kuih hynh a danthya nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia thawccinaw kha yn ngiapah lah, saw yn sangpya tua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Pachia ccungccapaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a ngiapya; te siapharan kuih tuh bua danthya zah atakaw lya hawte a dan vae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Siapharan nynh Pachia ccungccapaw kha, “Kamaw ryte ka inn lang cceihbua lah, looh aebua hin, lasung kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh siapharan kha, “Na peenaw angankuh kha nae pya zemah, na kalan ka cceihbua lan khyh; e hmin kya looh ka ae lan khyh, tui mah ka neih lan khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh kaw yn pya zah: Looh na ae lan khyh, tui mah na neih lan khyh, na ccianaw laanpi te na ki lan khyh, yn cipya,” cite a hopya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccangpaw laanpi te cceih zah, Bethel lang yn ccianaw laanpi te ki vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin Bethel khua kya ataw vae paw profeh lu kheit a um. A ccapaw hae oun thua hae zah, Pachia ccungccapaw nynh tuin nin Bethel khua kya a cyipaw balyn kha a hopya hae; siapharan a hopyapaw bya kha mah mih paaw kya a hopya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih paaw nynh minmin kha, “Paw laanpi kyate mou a ccia?” cite a khia hae. Judah ram kyate yn thuapaw Pachia ccungccapaw nynh a ccianaw laanpi kha a ccapaw hae nynh a hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te a ccapaw hae kyakhe, “Lann kha khungnin yn depah oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh lann kha khungnin depah hae zah a ccikuh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw kha deehui zah phaesi ku kaw a haungpaw kha a muih; te aning nynh, “Nang hynh Judah ram kyate yn thuapaw Pachia ccungccapaw na thua tou?” cite khia zah, tuh-e paw nynh, “Ka thua,” cite a khung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “Ka inn lang kamaw kya cceihbua lah, looh ae hin,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama tuh-e paw nynh, “Na kya ka kibua lan khyh, na inn lang mah ka teebua lan khyh; e hmin kyahin nang na kya looh ka ae lan khyh, tui mah ka neih lan khyh; <verse number="17" style="v" />pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh yn hopah zah: Tuin hmin kya looh na ae lan khyh, tui mah na neih lan khyh, na ccianaw laanpi te na ki lan khyh, yn cipya,” cite a hopya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te aning nynh tuh-e paw tuh, “Kae mah nang hawte profeh nynh ka thua; vaawpaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte yn hopah zah: Aning nynh looh ae zah tui mah a nia ccaw, na inn lang kikhae, yn cipya,” cite a hopya. Thuasalama aning nynh tuh-e paw kha a lingpaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia ccungccapaw tuh tuh-e profehpaw ryte kikheih hae zah, a inn kya looh ae zah tui mah a neih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aenaw ccaboi kya a haung lya hae khe, a kikhaetupaw profehpaw kalan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh yn thua zah, <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ram kyate yn thuapaw Pachia ccungccapaw kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na ngae khyh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh kaw ae pyapaw kawbya kha zui leite, <verse number="22" style="v" />na ki zah, ‘Looh ae nan, tui neih nan,’ cite ae hopyanaw hmin kyakhe looh na ae zah tui na nia keiccuze na pyn tuh na minpaaw hae shawku kya thua lan khyh, a ci,” cite a sia. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw tuh looh ae zah tui a neih koute, a kikhaetupaw profehpaw kya-e lann kha khungnin a depya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te a ccia lyakhe laanpi kya chindeih te tungkuh hae zah chindeih nynh phe a tei. A rhua tuh laanpi kya huekuh zah, lann tuh a pe a thadyn; chindeih tuh mah a rhua pe a thadyn. <verse number="25" style="v" />A rhua tuh laanpi kya huekuh zah chindeih tuh a rhua pe a thadynpaw kha khuaccong hae paw nynh a muih hae. Te cceih hae zah atawpaw profeh a umnaw khua kyakhe tuh-e tuh a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laanpi te yn kikhaetupaw profehpaw nynh tuh-e bya he a thae tuh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya a zui leipaw Pachia ccungccapaw nynh thua; tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopyapaw bya thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha chindeih kalan pya zah chindeih nynh tei zah a chia,” a ci. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te aning nynh a ccapaw hae kyakhe, “Lann kha khungnin yn depah oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh khungnin a depya hae, <verse number="28" style="v" />te cceih zah laanpi kya a rhua huekuh zah, a pe kya lann te chindeih a thadyn hae paw kha a muih. Chindeih nynh a rhua kha ae khyh, lann kha mah tei khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Profehpaw nynh Pachia ccungccapaw rhua kha lah zah lann tungvaw khang zah, rawhui khylan te uu khylan khualae lang a kikhae. <verse number="30" style="v" />A rhua kha amaw shawku kya a uu; te rawhui zah, “Ezou, ka neitawpaw!” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />A rhua kha a uh koute a ccapaw hae kyakhe, “He ka chih te, Pachia ccungccapaw a uukunaw shaw kya nae la uh cih oh; ka ru hae kha a ru hae pe khe na la nung cih oh. <verse number="32" style="v" />Pawccecize Bethel khua e silawhang te Samaria khua hae kya umpaw hmin hangpaw hae kya-e inn hae balyn kha rawse zah Pachia bya thyhte a sianuapaw bya tuh solei a la ccing cih,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />E acyihkuhpaw koute mah Jeroboam tuh a cciaseinaw laanpi kyate maeku leite, hmin hangpaw elang ranpibawi hae kha ccungccaw hae balyn laku e kha a khang hae; hmin hangpaw elang ranpibawi lang a tang rypaw miakaw kha a thyaasah hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />E hynh Jeroboam ciihan a zosahpaw te laephi vawlan kyate a rosahpaw seinaw lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam Ciihan Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Jeroboam ccapaw Abijah tuh a ccih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh a zu kha, “Thokuh lah, Jeroboam zu na thuapaw kha ae ny khyh ccaw hae, na muinsan rulaekuh lah, Shiloh khua lang la cceih; pawccecize hynh-e ccungccaw hae kya siapharan lang na tang cih cite yn hopahpaw profeh Ahijah tuh tuin khua kya a um. <verse number="3" style="v" />Sanlou apyngpaw ccanghaw, sanlou aphepaw beihtaraw te khoitui ling kheit la ccyngpah lah a kalan la cceih; imua tungvaw acyihkuh lanpaw kha ae hopah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jeroboam zu nynh tuhcite a cyi; thokuh zah Shiloh khua lang cceih zah Ahijah inn kya a thua. Ahijah tuh a taw vae keiccuze a mitmoh vae zah ngawmuih kho vae khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ahijah kha, “Jeroboam zu tuh a ccapaw a cci keiccuze a ccapaw konglang byakhia khylan na kalan yn cceih cciamang. Aning kha tuhte khahte na hopah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Aning he yn thua tuh, ccangpaw nopi lante a muinsan a rulaeku. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama thuakaw kya yn tee zah a laanccia siho kha Ahijah nynh he a thae tuh, “Jeroboam zu, yn tee; pawccemou mingccangpaw hawte na umsaku? Pawccecize nang na elang thethyapaw hopya lan kae hynh naw ka thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />La cceih lah, Jeroboam kha, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Ccungccaw hae laku kyate nang kha kae hangthung zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae cciakhaetu lang kae rae, <verse number="8" style="v" />David ciihan kyate peenaw kha ka lah zah nang kha kae pya; tuhzemah ka kawbya kha zui zah a thinlung balynte kae kha yn zui zah ka muihnaw kya akyhpaw kyalya a cyihtupaw ka ryalahtu David hawte na thua khyh, <verse number="9" style="v" />nang tuh nang na maw e ccungccaw hae balyn laeze hoyleinaw kha na raehua vae, ka thinriasah khylan ccangpaw pachia hae kha raekute azuh hae kha na raekuh zah kae kha na nulang nae vua; <verse number="10" style="v" />tukeiccuze Jeroboam ciihan kya hoyleinaw kha ka thuasah cih. Jeroboam kya-e pise miakaw, Israel ram kyaze a luepaw thuasah, a lue leipaw thuasah ka vua cih hae zah, ccungccaw nynh ia kha marya a phi hawte Jeroboam ciihan kha ka maemih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">1Si 15.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeroboam te asekuhpaw ccungccaw miakaw khualae lungkhu a chihpaw kha ui nynh a ae cih; ramkaw kya a chihpaw miakaw kha azouthyapaw pavaw nynh a ae cih; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe a ho vae,’ cite la hopah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thokuh lah, na inn lang la cceih. Na ccu nynh khua lungkhu he a sy te, imua tuh a chih cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel hae balyn nynh amaw hanlan a rah cih hae zah a uh cih hae; pawccecize Jeroboam innbyn kyaze amaw kyalya hynh shawku kya uu athua cih, pawccecize Jeroboam ciihan kyaze amaw tungvaw kya rou nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh ccapyh a lungrythua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhpiaze atunin, atu ccyh kya maw hin, Jeroboam ciihan a zosah cih paw Israel siapharan lu kheit kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw elang a langsakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Phaeku kha tui lungkhu kya hy athua hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha a hy cih; mih minpaaw hae a pya hae paw hynh-e ram hoypaw kyate Israel kha poh a khaee cih, Zufrates vaw khuraw lang cia phiariphiarae a nung cih hae, pawccecize minmin nynh Asherah zohtuh hae kha raekute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thin a riasah hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh amaw a seinaw keiccu te Israel hae kha seinaw a raesah hae keiccuze Israel kha a vua cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Jeroboam zu tuh thokute cceih zah Tirzah khua a thua. Inn thuakaw kya he a tee lyakhe imua tuh a chih. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu profeh Ahijah kyate a hopaw bya thyhte, Israel hae balyn nynh imua kha uh hae zah a rah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jeroboam Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jeroboam a ryalawnaw hae, pawtemou rhaw a tuk cipaw te pawtemou a uk cipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboam nynh kum kuin lae ning a uk; a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah a ccapaw Nadab tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2Sh 11.5—12.15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam nynh Judah ram kha a uk. A uk takaw lya tuh sung pali kum kheit acih vae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw min kha nung nawlan Israel phin hae balyn kyate a popaw Jerusalem khua kya kum haw lae sari a uk. A nung tuh Ammon minphuin Naamah nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Judah hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae hae; mih minpaaw hae nynh a rae hae paw seinaw balyn laeze alunghua lante a rae hae paw mih seinaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinriasah hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize ahangpaw mua miakaw te hinlalyhpaw thingku kaw miakaw khe hmin hangpaw hae, zohtuh hae te Asherah zohtuh hae kha a raeku hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:9-10">2Si 17.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />beikinn kya a ohhuakuhpaw pise hae kha mah ram lungkhu kya a um hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang kyate a dee hae paw minphuin hae nynh a cyi hae paw anungsikuhpaw balyn kha a cyibua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Deu 23.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehoboam nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum pangawnaw kum khe Izip siapharan Shishak nynh Jerusalem kha tuk lan a ccianua thung; <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya-e sisua hae te siapharan inn kya-e sisua hae kha a law hae. Atyn-are pong a law. Solomon nynh a raepaw sui khawriaphua balyn kha mah pong a law;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:16-17">1Si 10.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:15-16">2Sh 9.15-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />tukeiccuze Rehoboam Siapharan nynh sohin khawriaphua hae kha raeru zah, siapharan inn thuakaw a ngaw hae paw rhawviatu hae kya-e bawi hae kha a ap hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang a tee takyh vae ze, rhawviatu hae nynh khawriaphua hae kha a ccyngku hae, te rhawvianaw khaan kyakhe bua leih a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Rehoboam nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kyakhe a zei hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Rehoboam te Jeroboam tuh rhaw po a tukkuh hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Rehoboam tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah David khua kyakhe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae. A nung tuh Ammon minphuin Naamah nynh thua. A ccapaw Abijam nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Abijam nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2Sh 13.1—14.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam Siapharan nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae taryanaw kum khe Abijam nynh Judah ram kha uk takaw zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kya kum thum a uk. A nung tuh Abishalom ccanung Maakah nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning mawze a paaw nynh a la raepaw seinaw balyn kha a raebua; a minpaaw David thinlung hawte thua leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia kya a thinlung a lungzi khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama David keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia nynh Jerusalem kya maeekhua ccangkheit a pya, amaw koute a ccapaw kha hangthung zah, Jerusalem khua kha a tynsah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1Si 11.36</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize David nynh Hit ccungccaw Uriah kong laelan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha cyih zah, kaw a pyapaw miakaw kha a she lungkhu balyn ccangkheit sanmah maetawkuh khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1-27">2Sa 11.1-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />A she lungkhu balyn, Rehoboam te Jeroboam tuh rhaw po a tukkuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Abijam nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Judah Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Abijam tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, David khua kya a uu hae. Te a ccapaw Asa tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Asa nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2Sh 15.16—16.6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel Siapharan Jeroboam nynh ram a uknaw kum kuinnaw khe, Asa nynh Judah ram kha a uk takaw; <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem kyate sung pali kum kheit a uk. A minnung tuh Abishalom ccanung Maakah nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />A minpaaw David nynh a la cyi hawte, Asa nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a cyi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Beikinn kya a ohhuakuhpaw pise hae kha ram kyate dee hae zah a minpaaw hae nynh a la rae hae paw zohtuh hae balyn kha a nue hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />A minnung Maakah kha mah Asherah elang anungsikuhpaw zohtuh a rae keiccuze siapharan a nung thuanaw kyate a haeungsah; a zohtuh kha Asa nynh ropah zah Kidron Vaw pe khe maee te a soi. <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmin hangpaw hae kha a ro khyh hae zemah, a she lungkhu balyn Asa thinlung tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya a lungzi. <verse number="15" style="v" />A paaw nynh byakinkute a hlupaw lasung hae te amaw nynh byakinkute a hlupaw sui, ngun te angphe hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu langkhe a nung.</para>
  <para style="s1">Asa te Benhadad A Pankheih hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa te Israel siapharan Baasha tuh mih she lungkhu balyn rhaw po a tukkuh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel siapharan Baasha nynh Judah ram kha tuk lan ccianua zah, Judah siapharan Asa kalan humhung mah a pou lei nawlan te a tee lei nawlan Ramah khua kha a rae. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn te siapharan inn kya-e sisuakhaan kya umpaw alaepaw sisua hae, sui te ngun balyn kha Asa nynh marya lah zah, a ryalahtu hae kuih kya a pya hae. Damaskas khua umpaw Siria siapharan, Hezion ccapaw Tabrimmon a ccapaw Benhadad kalan khe ccungccaw saw hae zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka paaw te na paaw nynh a la pankheih hae hawte, kae te nang mah pankheih sih; sui te ngun hynh lasung lang kae ky; Israel siapharan Baasha nynh kae hynh yn kitaw nawlan, aning te na pankheihnaw oh kha roh ccavae,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="20" style="v" />Benhadad nynh Siapharan Asa bya kha ngae zah, Israel khua hae kha tuk khylan a rhawbawi hae kha sawnua hae zah, Ijon, Dan, Abel-beth-maakah, Khinneroth balyn te Naftali ram balyn kha a tae hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Baasha nynh he a thae te, Ramah khua a raepaw kha haeungtaw zah Tirzah khua kya a um. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Siapharan Asa nynh Judah ram balyn kha thaesah hae zah, lu kheit san a lue lei lante, Baasha nynh Ramah khua a raenawpaw lung hae te thing hae kha a law hae, tuh-e tuhte Siapharan Asa nynh Mizpah khua te Benjamin ram e Geba khua kha a rae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Asa nynh rya a lawpaw balyn, a huhan balyn, a cyipaw balyn te khua hae a raepaw tuh Judah Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. Thuasalama he a taw te, a ccu kya ccinaw a hoi. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Asa tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a minpaaw David khua kyakhe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae; a ccapaw Jehoshafat tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nadab nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum ningnaw kum khe Jeroboam ccapaw Nadab nynh Israel ram kha a uk takaw; aning nynh Israel ram kha kum ning a uk. <verse number="26" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae, a paaw laanpi kha zui zah Israel hae seinaw raesahpaw laanpi kha a zui.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Issakhar phin, Ahijah ccapaw Baasha nynh Nadad kha aruh lante paccynnuakuh zah, Filistin hae khua athuapaw Gibbethon khua kya a chia; pawccecize Nadad te Israel balyn nynh Gibbethon khua kha a koihlu hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhcite Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum kumthumnaw khe Baasha nynh Nadab kha theih zah, amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="29" style="v" />Siapharan lang he a tang takaw te, Jeroboam ciihan balyn kha a chia hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu Shiloh khuapaw Ahijah kyate a hopaw bya thyhte, marya a ro mawlaezung Jeroboam ciihan kha a hysuepaw lu kheit san haang khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1Si 14.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v" />pawccecize Jeroboam nynh amaw a seipaw seinaw te Israel hae kha seinaw a raesahpaw seinaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thin a riasah keiccu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Nadad nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Asa te Israel Siapharan Baasha tuh mih she lungkhu balyn rhaw a tukkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Baasha nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum kumthumnaw khe Ahijah ccapaw Baasha nynh Tirzah khua kyate Israel balyn kha kum kuin lae pali a uk. <verse number="34" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae, Jeroboam laanpi kha zui zah, Israel hae seinaw raesahpaw laanpi kha a zui.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Baasha konglang te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Hanani ccapaw Jehu kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang kha laenoi kyate kae hangthung zah ka ccungccaw Israel hae cciakhaetu lang kae rae salamah, Jeroboam laanpi kha na zui zah ka ccungccaw Israel hae kha seinaw na raesah hae zah mih seinaw khate ka thin nae riasah, <verse number="3" style="v" />tukeiccuze nang Baasha te na ciihan hae kha kae maemih cih oh zah, na innbyn tuh Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam ciihan hawte ka thuasah cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Baasha te asekuhpaw ccungccaw miakaw khualae lungkhu a chihpaw kha ui nynh a ae cih; ramkaw kya a chihpaw miakaw kha azouthyapaw pavaw nynh a ae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Baasha nynh rya a lawpaw, a cyipaw te a huhan kha Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Baasha tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Tirzah khua kya a uu hae; te a ccapaw Elah nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhpiaze Baasha tuh a kuih ryalawnaw khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thinriasah zah, a muihnaw kya a cyipaw hoyleinaw balyn keiccu thuasah, Jeroboam ciihan te lokuh hae zah, tuh-e ciihan a ropaw seinaw keiccu thuasah, Baasha te a ciihan konglang kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Hanani ccapaw profeh Jehu kyate yn thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Siapharan Elah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum kuin lae taruhnaw kum khe Baasha ccapaw Elah nynh Tirzah khua kyate Israel ram kha kum ning a uk. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama a marangle angankuh a uktupaw a ryalahtu Zimri nynh aruh lante a phee. Tirzah khua a um lya, a innbyn a do-oihtu Arza inn kya phe rui lan a nia lyakhe, <verse number="10" style="v" />Zimri tuh yn tee zah, Elah kha bua zah phe a theih koute amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. E tuh Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum kuin lae sarinaw kum kya nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram he uk takaw zah a bawitungkhung kya he a haung takaw te, Baasha ciihan hae kha marya a chia hae; a puizia te a ruiban hae kha pise lu kheit sanmah haang khyh hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Baasha konglang profeh Jehu kyate a hopaw bya thyhte, Zimri nynh Baasha ciihan balyn kha marya a ro, <verse number="13" style="v" />pawccecize Baasha te a ccapaw Elah nynh a rae hae paw mimaw seinaw te Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw, te mih zohtuh hae khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thinriasah hae keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Elah nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Siapharan Zimri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw kum kuin lae pangaw kum khe, Zimri nynh Tirzah khua kya nin sari a uk. Te Israel rhawkaw hae nynh Filistin hae kya-e Gibbethon khua kha ryahmin a tahnuaku hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />te tuh-e ryahmin tahnuakuh hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh, “Zimri nynh aruh lante paccynkuh zah siapharan kha a chia vae,” cipaw a thae hae; tukeiccuze tuin nin khe Israel balyn nynh rhawbawipaw Omri kha Israel siapharan lang ryahmin kya a khang hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Omri nynh Israel hae balyn ryte Gibbethon khua kyate cceihthung hae zah Tirzah khua kha a koihlu hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua kha a law vae hae cipaw Zimri nynh he a nyh tuh, siapharan inn kya-e rhawlungrua koihkuhpaw lungkhu lang tee zah, siapharan inn kha maee te soi zah amaw mah a chih, <verse number="19" style="v" />pawccecize Jeroboam laanpi kha zui zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae zah amaw nynh a raepaw seinaw te amaw nynh Israel hae kha seinaw a raesah hae keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Zimri nynh rya a lawpaw te aruh lante a paccynpaw tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Siapharan Omri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel hae tuh phu ning lang a phiakuh hae; ccungccaw angankuh nynh Ginath ccapaw Tibni kha siapharan lang khangku lan zui hae zah, angankuh nynh Omri kha a zui hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Omri a zui hae paw nynh Ginath ccapaw Tibni a zui hae paw kha a tae hae; tukeiccuze Tibni tuh chih zah Omri tuh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw sung thum kum kheitnaw kum khe Omri nynh Israel kha a uk takaw; kum haw lae ning uk zah kum taruh tuh Tirzah khua kya a uk.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khuapi Thawpaw Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Omri nynh Shemer kya-e Samaria mua kha ngun talent ccangning te a re; te rhawlungrua te koihkuhpaw khua kha a rae koute mua a la hoitupaw Shemer min kha lee zah khua tuh Samaria cite min a phu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Omri nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha a rae; aning mawze a la um hae paw balyn laeze hoyleinaw kha a raehua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam laanpi miakaw kha zui zah, mih zohtuh hae khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thinriasahte, Israel hae a raesah hae paw seinaw laanpi kha a zui. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Omri nynh a cyipaw, huhan a langsahkupaw kha Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Omri tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, Samaria khua kya a uu hae; a ccapaw Ahab nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Siapharan Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah siapharan Asa nynh ram a uknaw sung thum kum taryanaw kum khe, Omri ccapaw Ahab nynh Israel ram kha a uk takaw; Omri ccapaw Ahab nynh Samaria khua kyate Israel ram kha kum kuin lae ning a uk. <verse number="30" style="v" />Omri ccapaw Ahab nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya aning mawze a la um hae paw balyn laeze hoyleinaw kha a raehua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam nynh a raepaw seinaw laanpi kya zui tuh amaw hanlan zawbahaepaw uccaw lang ria zah, aning nynh Sidon hae siapharan Ethbaal ccanung Jezebel kha zu lang a hoiku, te cceih zah Baal pachia kha ryalawpah zah a beik. <verse number="32" style="v" />Samaria khua kya a sakpaw Baal pachia inn lungkhu khe Baal pachia elang silawhang kha a raepya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahab nynh Asherah kha mah a rae. Ahab nynh aning mawze a la um hae paw Israel siapharan balyn laeze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thin a riasah hua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahab she lyakhe Bethel khuapaw Hiel nynh Jeriko khua kha a rae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Nun ccapaw Joshua kyate a la hopaw bya thyhte, khua aleihpaw bing lyakhe a ccatawccaw Abiram hiinnaw kha zosah zah, khua koikua a rae lyakhe a ccasoi Segub hiinnaw kha a zosah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Jos 6.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Elijah nynh Khuaakan lanpaw A Hodae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead ram Tishbe khuapaw Tishbe ccungccaw Elijah nynh Ahab kha, “Ka beikpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh a hiin thyhte, kae ka bya leite, e kum hae kya dangtui ccah lan khyh zah khuaa mah rah lan khyh,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:17">Jam 5.17</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Elijah kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />“E hmin kyate pou lah, nithua langsang la cceih, te Jordan vaw nithua lang umpaw Kherith Vaw pe khe zya la rekuh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaw kya-e tui kha na neih cih, tuin kyakhe nang kha looh pya khylan va-aw hae kha kaw ka pya vae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze cceih zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte a cyi; aning nynh cceih zah Jordan nithua lang umpaw Kherith Vaw pe khe a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Va-aw hae nynh awkhua takyh zete takyhte sanlou te saw kha a pya hae; te vaw kya-e tui kha a nia. <verse number="7" style="v" />Sosoh aro koute ram lungkhu kya khuaa araw khyh keiccuze vaw tuh akan vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zarefath Nomaenung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Elijah kalan yn thua zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thokuh lah, Sidon ram e Zarefath khua lang cceih lah, tuin kya la um; nang kha looh dang khylan tuin khua umpaw nomaenung kha kaw ka pya vae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:25-26">Luk 4.25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thokuh zah Zarefath khua lang a cceih. Khua koikua kya he a thua te, nomaenung lu kheit tuh thingpareih kha a la khu cciamang; Elijah nynh nopinung kha ko zah, “Ka nia lanpaw tui beihtaraw kha banang te yn pyatua,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nopinung nynh tui law lan a ccia lyakhe, aning nynh kohui zah, “Na kuih te sanlou beihtaraw nae ccyngpah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nopinung nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh a hiin thyhte, aruakuh vae paw sanlou phe kheit sankaw ka hoi khyh, ang lungkhu kya vaekhui kuihphe kheit kyalya te chitui-ung lungkhu kya chitui beihtaraw rou nynh ka hoi; inn lang kite tuh-e tuh kae te ka ccapaw elang anghyngnaw lanpaw thingpareih beihtaraw nynh ka la khu cciamang; tuh-e kae ae koute tuh kanmawte kae chi lanpaw nynh um vae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijah nynh aning kha, “Na thawsia nan sah; cceih lah, kae hopya hawte la cyih; thuasalama masaty lan kamaw elang sanlou phe kheit yn raepah lah yn pyaty, tukoute namaw te na ccapaw elang ccangkhakheit kha na cyih cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi vawlan khuaa a rawsah mawlaezung, ang kya vaekhui thang lan khyh zah chitui-ung kya chitui thang lan khyh,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te nomaenung nynh cceih zah Elijah nynh a ho thyhte a cyi; te amaw ry, Elijah ryte a innbyn hae nynh khaw cia a ae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Elijah kyate a hopaw a bya thyhte, vaekhui ang kya vaekhui thang khyh zah, chitui-ung kya chitui thang khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elijah nynh Nomaenung Ccapaw A Dansah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e koute, innzuaanung nopinung ccapaw tuh ccih zah, myaryamaw a cci keiccuze a hy phe thang. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh nomaenung nynh Elijah kha, “Pou Pachia ccungccapaw, pawccemou kae hynh nae rawse? Ka seinaw kha liathuisah lan te ka ccapaw kha chisah khylan tou ka kalan nae thua!” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Elijah nynh nomaenung kha, “Na ccapaw kha yn pya,” a cipya. Aning nynh nomaenung by vaw e ccapaw kha lah zah, a inaw palung khaan langkhe kaekhae zah a ikhung kyakhe a nung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Elijah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, innccong ka thuanaw nomaenung tungvaw kya heize a ccapaw kha chiapyate vawsawnaw na thuakhae tou?” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te imua kha vae thum bakhungnua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan khe, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, e imua hiinnaw hynh a lungkhu lang bua tee sah,” cite a sia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:34-35">2Si 4.34-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Elijah roi kha thaepah zah, imuapaw hiinnaw tuh a lungkhu lang bua teethui zah a hiinthui. <verse number="23" style="v" />Elijah nynh imua kha lah zah palung khaan kyate inn lungkhu lang rungkhae bung zah a nung kha a pya; te Elijah nynh, “Dotua, na ccapaw tuh a hiin,” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh nopinung nynh Elijah kha, “Atu tuh nang tuh Pachia ccungccaw nynh na thua cipaw te na munglae kya umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh byaccing nynh thua cipaw ka ny vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Elijah nynh Ahab A Hopyapaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccyh khaw cia ro zah kum thumnaw kum khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Elijah kalan yn thua zah, “La cceih lah, Ahab kha la muihsakuh; laephi vawlan khuaa ka rawsah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Elijah tuh Ahab kalan muihsahku khylan a cceih. Samaria ram kya ccakan accih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahab nynh siapharan inn do-oihtu Obadiah kha a ko. (Obadiah tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha myarya saw a tuapaw nynh thua; <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezebel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh hae kha he a theih hae tuh, Obadiah nynh profeh za kheit kha ko hae zah, sung pangaw ccite lungkarung kya thuruh hae zah tui te looh a pya hae.) <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Ahab nynh Obadiah kha, “Ram lungkhu po lekuh lan, tuidy hae balyn te vaw hae balyn kalan khe la cciatua; sahiin hae abang kha shung leite, marang hae te lann hae a hiin nawlan hae, aening nynh lonua hae kha ah muihpah kho oh,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ram kha po lekuh lan ccia khylan neekuh hae zah, Ahab tuh amaw ccangte voikheih lang cceih zah, Obadiah mah amaw ccangte ccanglang a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Obadiah tuh laanpi kya a ccia lyakhe Elijah nynh amaw kha yn tungku; Obadiah nynh Elijah kha a syntaw, te bakhungpah zah, “Nang hynh ka bawipaw Elijah na thua khaw?” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Kamaw nynh ka thua. Na bawipaw kalan la cceih lah, e kya Elijah mang um cite la hopah,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Obadiah nynh, “Na ryalahtupaw kae hynh chia khylan Ahab kuih kalan pya lan ciate pawtemou ka sei? <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh a hiin thyhte, nang kha ccung khylan ka bawipaw nynh yn saw leinaw ram te minphuin um vae khyh; minmin nynh, ‘E kya Elijah um khyh,’ cite a ho vae hae ze, nang kha kae muih khyh cite tuh-e ram te minphuin kha thya leih a lawsahku hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te atu tuh nang nynh, ‘La cceih lah, e kya Elijah mang um cite na bawipaw kha la hopah,’ nae cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Namaw kyate he ka cceih takaw te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw nynh nang kha ka ny leinaw hmin lang ae cciakhae cih; tukeiccuze Ahab kha ka hopah zah nang kha he ae muih kho khyh te, kae hynh yn theih vae cih, na ryalahtupaw kae tuh ka di lya mawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha saw ka tua vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jezebel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh hae a chia lya hae ze, pawtemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh hae za kheit kha sung pangaw ccite lungkarung kya ka thuruh hae zah tui te looh ka pya hae cipaw kha ka bawipaw nang hynh ae hopah khyh hae tou? <verse number="14" style="v" />Atu tuh nang nynh, ‘La cceih lah, e kya Elijah mang um cite na bawipaw kha la hopah,’ nae cipya; aning nynh solei yn theih vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Ka beikpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, atunin Ahab malang ka langkuh ccaccing cih,” a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Obadiah nynh Ahab kalan cceih zah a hopya; te Ahab tuh Elijah te tungku khylan a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahab nynh Elijah kha he a muih te, “Nang hynh Israel kha vawsaw a pyatu na thua tou?” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “Kae nynh Israel kha vawsaw ka pya khyh; nang te na paaw ciihan hae nynh khaw na pya oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya hae kha na vua oh zah Baal hae kha na zui oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel balyn, Baal profeh hae za pali sung pangaw te Jezebel ccaboi kya a ae hae paw Asherah profeh hae za pali kha kamaw kalan Karmel Mua kya oun pum oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Elijah nynh Baal Ranpibawi hae Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ahab nynh Israel hae balyn kalan ccungccaw saw zah, profeh hae tuh Karmel Mua kya a sueluakuh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Elijah tuh ccungccaw balyn kalan yn naekuh zah, “Alokuh leipaw tuanaw ccangning khate hohseciamou ccubae te na cceih ung cih oh? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia athua ze, amaw kha zui oh; thuasalama Baal tuh Pachia athua ze, amaw kha zui oh,” a cipya hae. Te ccungccaw hae nynh bya kaw kheit san khung khyh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh Elijah nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh tuh kamaw kyalya nynh ka um vae; thuasalama Baal profeh hae tuh za pali sung pangaw a um hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tangnuapaw sa ning kha kaening kalan oun cciakhae oh; minmin nynh tangnuapaw sa kheit kha pokuh hae sah, ditaraw lan pong be hae sah lah, thing vawlan khe nung hae sah, maee tyh nan hae sah; te kae nynh mah ccangpaw tangnuapaw sa kheit kha ka be cih zah thing vawlan khe ka nung cih, maee ka tyh lan khyh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te nanning nynh nae pachia min kha na ko cih oh zah kae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha ka ko cih; maee te oun leihrupaw pachia tuh Pachia ccaccing nynh thua,” a cipya hae. Ccungccaw hae balyn nynh, “Na hopaw tuh ahoy!” a ci hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Elijah nynh Baal profeh hae kha, “Nanning tuh na lung oh keiccuze tangnuapaw sa kheit kha pokuh ty oh lah paccyn oh, te maee tyh leite nae pachia min kha ko oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />A pya hae paw tangnuapaw kha minmin nynh lah hae zah a paccyn hae, te Baal min kha awkhua te ninthu cia ko hae zah, “Pou Baal, kaening hynh beih oun leihtua!” a ci hae. Thuasalama pawpaw roi mah ccae khyh zah leih mah leihru khyh hae. Mimaw nynh a rae hae paw silawhang pepan khe a law hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Ninthu khe Elijah nynh sarya hae zah, “Thawte sia oh! Aning tuh pachia ccaccing nynh thua; ccangpaw kha tah a tua cciamang, tuhkhyhze ccanglang tah a khiavuiku, tuhkhyhze khycce lang tah a ccia, tuhkhyhze a i keiccuze tho aho ccamah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te minmin nynh thawte sia hae zah, mimaw phung thyhte mih chii alua mawlaezung tangpaw te thaloi khate mimaw toulou kha a awku hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Ninthu laeleih zah zetesang silaw ccyh cia a sia a rua hae zemah, pawpaw roi mah ccae khyh, khungrupaw bya te leihrupaw bya um khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh Elijah nynh ccungccaw balyn kha, “Ka kalan oun naekuh oh,” cipah hae zah ccungccaw balyn tuh amaw kalan a naekuh hae. Te aning nynh a ro vae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang kha masaty a raethui; <verse number="31" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh amaw kalan yn thua zah, “Na min tuh Israel acikuh cih,” cite a cipyapaw Jakob a ccapaw hae mih phin zeihte, Elijah nynh lung ccanghaw lae ning kha a law; <verse number="32" style="v" />tuh-e lung hae khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te silawhang kha a rae. Te ccacii tounawpaw te kaw ning accawng lante tuh-e silawhang po voilu lan tuizy a zy. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thing kha po nung zah, tangnuapaw kha pong a be koute tuh-e thing vawlan khe a khang. Te aning nynh, “Ang ccangpali kha tui phe biasah oh lah, maee-ute silawnawpaw te thing kha tui bu oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “Vae ningnaw tui bu oh,” cipah hae zah minmin nynh vae ningnaw tui a bu hae. Te aning nynh, “Vae thumnaw tui bu oh,” bua cipah hae zah minmin nynh vae thumnaw tui a bu hae, <verse number="35" style="v" />te tui tuh silawhang po voilu lan lua zah tuizy kya tui phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zetesang silawnaw rae ccyh kyakhe, profeh Elijah tuh silawhang kalan yn naekuh zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Abraham, Isak te Israel Pachia, nang tuh Israel hae kya Pachia na thuapaw kha thuasah, kae tuh na ryalahtu ka thua zah hynh-e uccaw balyn hynh namaw bya thyhte nynh ka cyi cipaw kha thuasah atunin nyh hae sah. <verse number="37" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e ccungccaw hae nynh nang tuh Pachia na thuapaw kha ae ny nawlan hae te mih thinlung kha na paleih nawlan hae, ka bya hynh beih yn thaepya tua, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, beih yn thaepya tua,” cite saw a sang. <verse number="38" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> maee tuh yn ccah zah, maee-ute silawnawpaw, thing, lung te laenoi kha u zah, tuizy kya-e tui kha heize phe a rousah. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh tuh-e tuh he a muih hae te, bakhung hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia athua ccaccing; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia athua ccaccing,” a ci hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Elijah nynh minmin kha, “Baal profeh hae kha kyng oh; lu kheit sanmah zuasah nan oh,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh tuh-e profeh hae kha a kyng hae; Elijah nynh minmin kha Kishon Vaw kalan cciakhae bung hae zah a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khuaakannaw Athang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elijah nynh Ahab kha, “Cceihthung lah, la ae lah la neih, pawccecize khuaa myarya ccanpaw roi accae,” a cipya. <verse number="42" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ahab tuh ae lan te nia lan a cceihthung. Elijah tuh Karmel mua dung lang a kaethung, tuin kyakhe laephi kya bakhung zah a mae kha a ccukharu hae laku kya a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.42-45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:18">Jam 5.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="43" style="v" />Te a ryalahtupaw kha, “Cceihthung lah, rili kalan khe dotua,” a cipya. Aning nynh cciathungte do zah, “Pawpaw mah um khyh,” a cipya. Te Elijah nynh, “Vae sari cia buabua cciatua,” a cipya. <verse number="44" style="v" />Vaesarinaw kyakhe, “Dotua, ccungccaw kuih ciapaw maeking taraw tuh rili lungkhu te yn kaethung,” a cipya. Te Elijah nynh, “La cceih lah, Ahab kha, ‘Khuaa nynh phang ae khaw mawkhe na marangle kha paccynkuh lah, cceihbung ccavae,’ cite la hopah,” a cipya. <verse number="45" style="v" />Sosoh aro te vaawlui tuh maeking te khisan te pong yn moh zah khuaa myarya accan. Ahab tuh marangle ccikuh zah Jezreel khua lang a cceih. <verse number="46" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh Elijah tungvaw um zah, a taevoiboei kha voikuh zah Ahab malang khe Jezreel teenaw kalan a ccue.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jezebel kyate Elijah A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elijah nynh a cyipaw balyn te thaloi te profeh hae balyn a chiapaw kha Ahab nynh Jezebel kya marya a hopya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Jezebel nynh Elijah kalan khe locceihtu lu kheit saw zah, “Na hiinnaw kha awkhualan atu ccyh kya tuh-e profeh hae hiinnaw hawte ka cyi khyh lanze, pachia hae nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e ciate thuasah, tuhlaeze alung lante mah thuasah cyih vae hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh Elijah tuh a ri keiccuze thokuh zah a hiinnaw lue khylan Judah ram e Beersheba khua lang a ccue; tuin kyakhe a ryalahtupaw kha a cciatawsya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaw tuh nin kheit laanccia ramkaw lang cceih zah innphi ku kaw a thua te a haung. Te a chi nawlan ngia zah, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, azaw vae; atu tuh ka hiinnaw hynh yn lah ccavae, pawccecize kae tuh ka minpaaw hae laeze ahoy huapaw ka thua khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 4:3">Jon 4.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Te innphi ku kaw marya a ih. Vaekheitmawte vaawpaw nynh hae zah, “Thokuh lah ae,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Elijah nynh do zah a luki khe lung asopaw vawlan aruakuhpaw sanlou phe kheit te tui ling kheit kha a muih. Ae zah a neih koute bua a ih. <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh vae ningnaw yn thua zah aning kha hae zah, “Na cceih cihnaw laanpi tuh myarya asaw keiccuze thokuh lah ae hin,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Thokuh zah a ae a neih; tuh-e looh thawzung tuhte nin sung pali te zi sung pali, Pachia mua Horeb langkhe a cceih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin hmin kya umpaw lungkarung kya thua zah a rya.</para>
  <para style="p">Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh a kalan yn thua zah, “Elijah, e kya pawmou na cyi?” cite a khia. <verse number="10" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaaw Pachia kha ccavyng ka pankhae; pawccecize Israel hae nynh na byakin kha vua hae zah na silawhang hae kha a ro hae, thaloi te na profeh hae kha theih hae zah, ka makhae nynh ka laehy vae, ka hiinnaw kha yn ccung hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:3">Rom 11.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Horeb Mua kya Elijah te Pachia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Pou lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang mua vawlan khe la thadyn, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh po yn cceih cih,” a cipya. Tetuh athawsaepaw khise tuh yn tho zah mua hae tuh paw hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe lungpi hae tuh a koi hae, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh khisan kya um khyh; khisan azaw koute innry asuekuh, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh innrysuekunaw kya mah um khyh; <verse number="12" style="v" />innrysuekuh koute maee a um; thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh maee kya mah um khyh; maee koute nevyalyapaw roi yn ccae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e roi tuh Elijah nynh he a thae te, a mae kha a angkiccua te a bongku, te pou zah lungkarung kalan teenaw arae khe a thadyn. Te amaw kalan khe, “Elijah, e kya pawmou na cyi?” cite roi yn ccae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Elijah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, vaaw Pachia kha ccavyng ka pankhae; pawccecize Israel hae nynh na byakin kha vua hae zah na silawhang hae kha a ro hae; thaloi te na profeh hae kha theih hae zah, ka makhae nynh ka laehy vae, ka hiinnaw kha yn ccung hae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “La ki lah, Damaskas ramkaw langkhe la cceih; he na thua te, Hazael kha Siria siapharan lang chitui na thuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:7-13">2Si 8.7-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimshi ccapaw Jehu kha mah Israel siapharan lang chitui na thuh cih; te Abelmeholah khuapaw Shafat ccapaw Elisha kha namaw ccelang profeh lang chitui na thuh cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1-6">2Si 9.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Hazael a thaloi kyate a luepaw miakaw kha Jehu nynh a theih cih; Jehu a thaloi kyate a luepaw miakaw kha Elisha nynh a theih cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhzemah Baal malang ccukharutung lei hae paw balyn, Baal a myng leipaw miakaw, Israel hae thong sari kha ka haang bang cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:4">Rom 11.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisha tuh Elijah Zuitu lang Tang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Elijah tuh tuin kyate cceih zah, Shafat ccapaw Elisha, leithue cciamangpaw kha a muih; a malang khe tangnua toi haw lae ning um hae zah amaw tuh toi haw lae ningnaw kyakhe a um. Elijah nynh a pe langkhe po cceih zah a angkiccua kha Elisha tungvaw a khang. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Elisha nynh a tangnua hae kha cciatawte Elijah kalan ccue zah, “Ka nung te ka paaw kha ka la myngsya hin hae, tukoute nang kha kae zui cih,” a cipya. Te Elijah nynh, “La ki ccaleih; pawccecize na tungvaw kya paw ka cyih zawtou?” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Elisha nynh ki zah tangnuapaw toi kheit kha cciakhae zah a chia; leithuenawpaw thing khate tangnuapaw saw kha a thung, te ccungccaw hae kha dang hae zah a ae hae. Te thokuh zah Elijah kha zui zah a ryalahtu lang a tang.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahab te Siria hae Doukunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siria siapharan Benhadad nynh a rhawkaw hae balyn kha a pum hae; siapharan hae sung thum lu ning, marang hae, marangle hae ryte Samaria kha ccianua hae zah koihlute a tuk hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Locceihtu hae kha Israel siapharan Ahab kalan, khua lungkhu lang saw hae zah, “Benhadad nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="3" style="v" />Na sui te na ngun hae tuh ka kya-e nynh thua; apuithya huaccepaw na zu hae te na ccaaw hae mah ka kya-e nynh thua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh, “Pou siapharan, ka bawipaw, na ho hawte kamaw te ka hoipaw balyn tuh namaw kya-e nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Locceihtu hae tuh bua oun thua hae zah, “Benhadad nynh hynhte a ho: Na kalan ccungccaw hae kae saw zah, ‘Na sui te na ngun, na zu na ccaaw hae kha ka kalan yn pya,’ cite bya kae taw; <verse number="6" style="v" />awkhualan atu ccyh kya ka ryalahtu hae kae saw cih hae, minmin nynh na inn te na ryalahtu hae inn lungkhu kya a ccung cih hae, a ry hae paw miakaw kha a lah cih hae zah a cciakhae cih hae,” cite bya a taw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh Israel siapharan nynh ram lungkhu e piccan hae balyn kha ko hae zah, “E ccungccapaw nynh pawtemou vawsawnaw a ccung cipaw hynh dotua oh! Aning nynh ccungccaw yn sawnua zah ka zu ka ccaaw hae, ka sui te ka ngun kha yn ngia zah ka ei khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te piccan hae balyn te ccungccaw hae balyn nynh, “A bya ngaepah nan, na nawccah nan sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Benhadad a locceihtu hae kha, “Siapharan ka bawipaw kha la hopah oh: Masaty nae ngiapaw miakaw kha tuh na ryalahtupaw nynh ka cyih cih; thuasalama e hynh tuh ka cyih kho khyh,” a cipya. Locceihtu hae nynh cceih hae zah bya kha a phu hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Benhadad nynh ccungccaw saw zah, “Kamaw yn zui hae paw lu kheit cci nynh Samaria khua e laenoi kha kuihphe kheit te a peih hae ze, pachia hae nynh ka tungvaw kya tuh-e laeze mah cyih vae sah,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh, “Aning kha la hopah oh: Rhawtuk-uccaw a lawkuhpaw nynh rhawtuk-uccaw a khahkuhpaw hawte pookuh nan sah,” cite bya a khung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Benhadad tuh siapharan hae ryte bu lungkhu kya a nia lya hae khe, tuh-e bya he a thae tuh, a ccungccaw hae kha, “Rhawtuk lan paccynkuh oh!” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh khua kha tuk khylan a paccynkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te profeh lu kheit tuh Israel siapharan Ahab kalan yn thua zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, hynh-e myarya lungpaw zapi hae hynh na muih vae hae tou? Dotua, atunin minmin kha na kuih kya kae pya cih; te nang nynh kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahab nynh, “Hum liate mou pya athua cih hae?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, pee a uktu bawi hae kya-e ryalahtu ccangvae hae liate pya athua cih,” a cipya. Te Ahab nynh, “Rhawtuk tuh hum nynh mou a thoty cih?” cite a khia. Profeh nynh, “Namaw,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Ahab nynh pee uktu bawi hae kya-e ryalahtu ccangvae hae kha pum hae zah za ning sung thum lu ning acih hae; tuh-e hae koute Israel hae balyn kha pum hae zah thong sari acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benhadad te a pan hae paw siapharan sung thum lu ning hae tuh bu kya phe rui lan a nia lya hae ninthu ccyh khe minmin tuh a cceih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pee uktu bawi hae kya-e ryalahtu ccangvae hae tuh masaty a cceih hae. Benhadad nynh rhawviatu hae kha saw hae zah tuh-e hae nynh, “Samaria khua kyate ccungccaw hae oun cceih hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Daenaw rae khylan oun ccia hae ze, ahiinte na kyng cih oh; rhawtuk khylan oun ccia hae zemah, ahiinte na kyng cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pee uktu bawi hae kya-e ryalahtu ccangvae hae te minmin a zuitu rhawkaw hae tuh khua kyate oun cceih vae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Israel hae lu kheit cci nynh rhaw hae lu kheit cci kha a chia hae; Siria hae tuh ccue hae zah Israel hae nynh a deehui hae, Siria siapharan Benhadad tuh marang ccikuh zah marang rhawkaw hae ryte phe a lue hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel siapharan tuh pou zah marang hae te marangle hae kha a tuk hae, Siria ccungccaw patae kha a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te profeh nynh Israel siapharan kalan yn cceih zah, “Na thawsaesakuh lah, na cyi lanpaw kha hoyte tuakuh; pawccecize hawnin ccyh yn thua te Siria siapharan nynh tuk lan ae ccianua cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siria hae Shungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siria siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh, “Israel hae mih pachia hae tuh mua pachia hae nynh thua, tukeiccuze minmin tuh aening laeze a thunghua hae; thuasalama minmin kha bialae kya tuk oh sih lah, aening tuh minmin laeze solei ah thunghua cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />E hynh mah cyitua: siapharan hae hynh phoh hae lah, rhawbawi hae kha khangru hae; <verse number="25" style="v" />na la shungpaw rhawkaw hae tahawpaw rhawkaw hae, marang hae tahawpaw marang hae te marangle hae tahawpaw marangle hae kha pum hae; te bialae kya tuk lan hae zah, aening tuh minmin laeze solei thunghua lan,” a cipya hae. Mih bya kha ngae zah tuhcite a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hawnin ccyh khe Benhadad nynh Siria hae kha pum hae zah Israel hae kha tuk khylan Afek khua lang a cceihthung hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel hae kha pum hae zah looh mah dang hae zah rhawtuk lan a cceih hae; Israel hae tuh miaa phu phuning taraw hawte Siria hae te arawsekunaw khe a rya hae, Siria hae tuh ram kya phe abeih hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw tuh Israel siapharan kalan yn cceih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Siria hae nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh mua pachia thua zah, accya pachia thua khyh,’ a ci hae, tukeiccuze e myarya lung hae paw zapi hae balyn hynh na kuih kalan kae pya cih zah, kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin tuh nin sari lungkhu phu kheit te phu kheit hawiliakute ryahmin a tahku hae. Nin sarinaw nin khe rhawtuk a thotakaw hae; Israel hae nynh Siria ccu rhawkaw hae cciing kheit kha nin kheit lungkhu a chia hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw hae tuh Afek khua lang a ccue hae; tuhlaepaw thong kuin lae sari kha khualungrua nynh a tingthin hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Benhadad mah ccuebua zah khua lungkhu kya a rekuh. <verse number="31" style="v" />A ryalahtu hae nynh, “Dotua, Israel ciihan siapharan hae tuh ngaethyaumsah thyapaw siapharan hae nynh athua hae cite kae thae; ah tae kya buriboei voikuh oh sih lah, ah lu vawlan liarui khangkute Israel siapharan kalan cceih oh sih; na hiinnaw hynh poh ae haang kho,” a cipya hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tukeiccuze buriboei kha mih tae kya voikuh hae zah liarui kha mih lu vawlan khangkute Israel siapharan kalan cceih hae zah, “Na ryalahtu Benhadad nynh, ‘Kae hynh beih yn hiin sah,’ ae ci,” cite a hopya hae. Te Ahab nynh, “A hiin ung tou? Aning tuh ka unopaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuh-e hae nynh bya a cciazia kha hoyte ngae hae zah, tuh-e bya tuh palou lawkuh hae zah, “Athua, Benhadad tuh na unopaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae. Te Ahab nynh, “Cceih oh lah, amaw kha yn cciakhae oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Benhadad tuh amaw kalan yn cceih; te Ahab nynh marangle tungvaw a ccisaku. <verse number="34" style="v" />Benhadad nynh, “Ka paaw nynh na paaw kya-e a lawpaw khua hae kha kae pyathui cih; ka paaw nynh Samaria khua kya kungku a la raeku hawte nang nynh mah Damaskas khua kya kungku na raekuh cih,” a cipya. Israel siapharan nynh, “E byakinnaw liate kae cciasah cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze nawccawthungkunaw kha rae hae zah a cciasah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Profeh nynh Ahab A Pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawpyanaw thyhte profeh phu kya-e lu kheit nynh a banpaw lu kheit kha, “Kae hynh yn bua!” a cipya. Thuasalama tuh-e paw nynh bua lan a mya. <verse number="36" style="v" />Te aning nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na ngae khyh keiccuze ka kyate he na cceih takaw te, chindeih nynh ae tei cih,” a cipya. Te a kyate he a cceih takaw te, chindeih te tungkuh hae zah phe a tei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:24">1Si 13.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Te ccangpaw lu kheit kha muih zah, “Kae hynh yn bua!” a cipya. Tukeiccuze tuh-e paw nynh thawte bua zah vaemaw a muesah. <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuh-e profeh tuh cceih zah a mae kha boei taraw bongkute a muinsan rulaekuh zah laante langkhe siapharan kha a ngaw. <verse number="39" style="v" />Siapharan yn ccia lyakhe siapharan kha ko zah, “Na ryalahtupaw kae tuh rhawtuknaw lang ka cceih; rhawkaw lu kheit tuh yn ki zah ka kalan ccungccapaw lu kheit kha yn cciakhae zah, ‘E paw hynh la do-oih; aning hynh he a zosei ze, a hiinnaw hanlan na hiinnaw kha chia athua cih, tuhkhyhze ngunphua talent ccangkheit na rung cih,’ yn cipya. <verse number="40" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw kae tuh voikheit voikheit lang ka ryasuh cciamang lyakhe aning tuh phe la cceih vae,” a cipya. Israel siapharan nynh, “Na byathan tuh tuhcihmawte byapia lanpaw nynh thua; namaw toulou nynh tuh-e byathan tuh bya phe na pae vae,” a cipya. <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuh-e profeh nynh a mae a bongkupaw boei taraw kha lyngkuh kangmaw zah, Israel siapharan nynh profeh hae laku e lu kheit nynh thua cipaw a syntaw. <verse number="42" style="v" />Te profeh nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Chia lan ka cipaw ccungccapaw kha na cciasah keiccuze na hiinnaw tuh a hiinnaw hanlan, na ccungccaw hae hiinnaw tuh a ccungccaw hae hiinnaw hanlan athua cih,’ a ci,” cite a hopya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel siapharan tuh thinriate maesuerote a inn lang cceih zah Samaria khua a thua.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Naboth Misu Khokhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute akawlan e hynh acyihkuh: Jezreel khuapaw Naboth nynh Jezreel khua kya Samaria siapharan Ahab inn pe khe misu khokhu a hoi. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahab nynh Naboth kha, “Na misu khokhu tuh ka inn pe a um keiccuze enaw-rohnaw khokhu lang ka mang ccaw, kamaw yn pya; ahoy huapaw misu khokhu kae pyaru cih; tuhkhyhze na ry ze, amee tuh phua lante kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Naboth nynh Ahab kha, “Ka minpaaw hae rho kha nang kae pya lanpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn khee vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Naboth nynh Ahab kha, “Ka minpaaw hae rho tuh kae pya lan khyh,” a cipya keiccuze Ahab tuh thinria maesuerote a inn lang a cceih. A ikhung kya ih zah a mae kha ccanglang hawi zah looh mah ae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zu Jezebel nynh a kalan yn cceih zah, “Looh ae lei lan ciate pawccemou hynhcih baban na lunghoy khyh?” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahab nynh, “Jezreel khuapaw Naboth kyakhe, ‘Na misu khokhu kha phua te kae re; tuhkhyhze na ryhua ze, ccangpaw misu khokhu mah kae pyaru cih,’ cite ka hopah zah, aning nynh, ‘Ka misu khokhu kha kae pya lan khyh,’ cite yn khung keiccu nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />A zu Jezebel nynh, “Atu lya Israel hynh nang nynh na uk khaw? Thokuh, looh beihtaraw ae lah, na lungpawsaku tua; Jezreel khuapaw Naboth misu khokhu kha kae pya cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ahab min te ccaw zei zah a tazeih khate tazeih a khia; te tuh-e ccaw tuh Naboth te a khua kya umkheih hae paw piccan hae te bawi hae kalan a ky. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh ccaw lungkhu khe, “Looh-aesungnaw kha thaesah oh lah, ccungccaw zapi malang khe Naboth kha haungsah oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />a ccouseikuh hae paw lu ning kha a malang khe nung oh lah, tuh-e hae nynh, ‘Nang nynh Pachia te siapharan kha thya na law hae,’ cite seibe hae sah. Te aning kha poukhae oh lah, lung te phe chih lan deih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />A khuaccaaw hae, a khua kya umpaw piccan hae te bawi hae nynh Jezebel nynh bya a taw hae thyhte a cyi hae. Aning nynh a ky hae paw ccaw kya azeiku thyhte, <verse number="12" style="v" />minmin nynh looh-aesungnaw kha thaesah hae zah ccungccaw zapi malang khe Naboth kha a haungsah hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />A ccouseikuh hae paw lu ning tuh oun cceih hae zah a malang khe a haung hae; tuh-e ccousei hae lu ning nynh ccungccaw hae malang khe Naboth kha seibe hae zah, “Naboth nynh Pachia te siapharan kha thya a law hae,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze khua atolang cciakhae hae zah lung te phe chih lan a deih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh Jezebel kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Naboth tuh lung te deih thua zah a chih vae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naboth tuh lung te deih hae zah a chih vae cipaw kha Jezebel nynh he a thae takaw te, Ahab kha, “Cceih lah, Jezreel khuapaw Naboth nynh phua te ae zuapya ry leipaw a misu khokhu kha lawkuh ccavae; pawccecize Naboth tuh hiin vae khyh, phe chih vae,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahab nynh Naboth a chih vae cipaw he a thae takaw te, Jezreel khuapaw Naboth misu khokhu kha lawku lan a cceihbung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Tishbe ccungccaw Elijah kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="18" style="v" />Samaria khua umpaw Israel siapharan Ahab kha tungku khylan la cceihbung; aning tuh lawku lan a ccianuapaw Naboth misu khokhu kya nynh atu a um. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Na theih zah a uccaw kha na lawku vae tou? a ci,” cite hopah. Te nang nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ui hae nynh Naboth chii a lyanaw hae hmin kyakhe na chii kha mah ui hae nynh a lya cih hae, a ci,” cite hopah, a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:38">1Si 22.38</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahab nynh Elijah kha, “Pou ka rhawpaw, phe nae muih vae tou?” a cipya. Elijah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahoy leipaw cyi khylan namaw toulou na zuaku vae keiccuze phe kae muih vae; <verse number="21" style="v" />na tungvaw hoyleinaw ka thuasah cih; nang kha kae maemih cih zah, Israel ram kya Ahab kya-e pise miakaw tuh a luepaw thuasah, a lue leipaw thuasah marya ka roh cih hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />ka thin nae riasah keiccu thuasah, Israel kha seinaw na raesah keiccu thuasah na ciihan hae kha Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam ciihan te Ahijah ccapaw Baasha ciihan hawte ka thuasah cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Jezebel te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Jezreel khua akoihkuhpaw lungkhu khe ui hae nynh Jezebel kha a ae cih hae,’ a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:36">2Si 9.36</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahab te asekuhpaw ccungccaw miakaw tuh khualae lungkhu a chihpaw kha ui nynh a ae cih; ramkaw kya a chihpaw miakaw kha azouthyapaw pavaw nynh a ae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Ahab tahawpaw humhung mah um khyh, aning tuh a zu nynh a tou keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahoy leipaw rae khylan amaw toulou a zuakuhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae malang te a dee hae paw Amor hae nynh a cyi hae hawte, zohtuh hae nulang zuikute anungsikuh huaccepaw kha Ahab nynh a rae.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahab nynh tuh-e bya he a thae tuh, a boeining kha seii zah a ngesaw ccakaepaw vawlan khe buriboei kha a zingku; looh-aesung zah buriboei kyakhe a ih, te lungrote a cceih bungthung. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Tishbe ccungccaw Elijah kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ahab nynh ka malang zakaw a sangsakupaw kha na muih vae tou? Aning nynh ka malang zakaw a sangsaku keiccuze a she lungkhu kya ronaw ka thuasah lan khyh; thuasalama a ccapaw she kya a ciihan tungvaw ronaw ka thuasah cih,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Profeh Mikaiah nynh Ahab Raeringnaw A Pya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2Sh 18.2-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siria ram te Israel ram tuh kum thum lungkhu rhawtukkuh khyh hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama kum thumnaw kyakhe Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh Israel siapharan kalan a cceihbung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Ramoth-gilead tuh aening kya-e nynh thua cipaw na nyh oh tou? Tuhzemah aening nynh Siria siapharan kuih kyate law leite daebabi lan ah umpya oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Aning nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Ramoth-gilead kha tuk khylan ka kya na cceihbua cih tou?” a cipya. Jehoshafat nynh Israel siapharan kha, “Nang te kae tuh pynkheihpaw nynh ah thua; ka ccungccaw hae tuh na ccungccaw hae thua hae zah, ka marang hae tuh na marang hae nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoshafat nynh Israel siapharan kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha khiatua ty hin,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh profeh hae za pali kha pum hae zah, “Ramoth-gilead kha tuk lan ka ccianua cih tou, ka ccianua lan khyh tou?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Ccianua thung; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan na kuih kalan ae pya cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Jehoshafat nynh, “Aening nynh khia lanpaw ccangpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh um vae khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhia nawlan ccangpaw lu kheit, Imlah ccapaw Mikaiah a um ung; tuhzemah aning kha ka hua, pawccecize kamaw konglang bya hoypaw ho boi khyh, ronaw kong cci nynh a ho,” a cipya. Jehoshafat nynh, “Tuhcite siapharan nynh byaho nan,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Israel siapharan nynh bawi lu kheit kha ko zah, “Imlah ccapaw Mikaiah kha arangte yn thuakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Israel siapharan te Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh mih angkiccua kikute, Samaria khua koikua teenaw malang huihmin kya umpaw bawitungkhung kya a haung hae; mih malang khe profeh balyn nynh profehbya a ho hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenaanah ccapaw Zedekiah nynh sivaw ki hae kha raekuh zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Siria hae kha ro athua mawlaezung hae, e sivaw ki hae hynhte na thuing cih oh, a ci,” cite a ho. <verse number="12" style="v" />Profeh balyn nynh mah tuhcite hobua hae zah, “Ramoth-gilead kha ccianua thung lah, taetua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan na kuih kya ae pya cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shung lanpaw Mikaiah nynh A Hodae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikaiah ko lan a cceihpaw locceihtupaw nynh Mikaiah kha, “Dotua, profeh hae nynh siapharan kyakhe bya hoypaw kha phe lokuh lante a hopya hae; nang nynh mah minmin hawte bya hoypaw kha hopah bua,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Mikaiah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn hopyapaw kyalya kha ka ho cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mikaiah tuh siapharan kya he a thua te, siapharan nynh, “Mikaiah, Ramoth-gilead kha tuk khylan kae ccianua cih tou, kae ccianua lan khyh tou?” a cipya. Mikaiah nynh, “Ccianua thung lah, taetua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh siapharan na kuih kya ae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan nynh, “Byaccingpaw laelan ccangpaw bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te nae hopya khyh nawlan, vae hohzeihmou bya kae kinsakuh cih?” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Israel hae balyn tuh tuurin a hoi leipaw tuu hae hawte mua vawlan phiariphiarae a um hae paw kha ka muih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘E hae tuh bawi hoi khyh hae; mimaw inn raveih lang daebabi lan ki hae sah,’ a ci,” cite a ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9.36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Aning tuh kae ka konglang hynh ahoypaw profehbya ho boi khyh, ronaw kong cci nynh a ho, cite kae hopah khyh tou?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Mikaiah nynh, “Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh thaetua: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a bawitungkhung kya haung zah, vaaw rhawkaw hae balyn tuh a voi a rang te a pe khe a thadyn hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6.1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Job 1.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Ahab tuh cceihthung zah Ramoth-gilead kya a chi nawlan, hum nynh mou a tuhou cih?’ a ci. Lu kheit nynh ccangte ho zah, ccangpaw lu kheit nynh ccangte a ho, <verse number="21" style="v" />muisaw lu kheit yn thua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thadyn zah, ‘Kamaw ka tuhou cih,’ a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Pawtemou na tuhou cih?’ cipah zah, aning nynh, ‘Ka cceih cih zah profeh hae munglae kyakhe ahynthyapaw muisaw lang ka tang cih,’ a ci. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, ‘Aning kha na la tuhou cih, phe na tuhou kho cih; la cceih lah tuhcite la cyih,’ a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahynthyapaw muisaw kha e na profeh hae balyn munglae kya a nung vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang na hanlan ronaw kaw a tho vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tetuh Khenaanah ccapaw Zedekiah nynh Mikaiah kha ccianua thung zah a mae kha bia zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh nang kha bya hopya khylan ka kyate paw laanpi te mou a pou?” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Nang nynh alungkhu lang e akhaan lungkhu lang reku khylan he na tee nin khe na muih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh, “Mikaiah kha kyng oh lah, khua uktu Amon te siapharan ccapaw Joash kalan cciakhae oh lah, <verse number="27" style="v" />‘Siapharan nynh hynhte kaw a tho: E ccungccaw hynh thonginn kya nung oh, daenaw te kae thua mawlaezung tui te looh beihtaraw kyalya la pya oh, a ci,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mikaiah nynh, “Daenaw te bua nae ki zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kyate bya a ho khyhpaw nynh athua cih. Pou ccungccaw hae, nae balynte thaetua oh!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab Shungnaw te Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2Sh 18.28-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel siapharan te Judah siapharan Jehoshafat tuh Ramoth-gilead khua lang a cceihthung hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Ka muinsan rulaekute rhawtuknaw lang ka cceihbua cih, thuasalama nang tuh na angkiccua kha kikuh,” a cipya. Tuhcite Israel siapharan tuh a muinsan rulaekuh zah rhawtuknaw lang a cceih. <verse number="31" style="v" />Siria siapharan nynh a marangle rhawbawi hae sung thum lu ning kha, “Ccangpaw ccungccaw adihpaw thuasah, alepaw thuasah tuk leite, Israel siapharan kyalya kha tuk oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Marangle rhawbawi hae nynh Jehoshafat kha he a muih hae te, “Aning hynh Israel siapharan ccaccing nynh thua,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze aning kha tuk khylan a maenuaku hae; te Jehoshafat nynh a sia. <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel siapharan thua khyh cipaw kha marangle rhawbawi hae nynh he a nyh hae te, aning kha deehui vae leite a kitaw hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Lukheitpaw nynh ee tutae leite a li te kaw huataw zah, Israel siapharan kha a rhawtuk-uccaw te a bykhaw laku khe a tungsah; tukeiccuze a marangle a mawngtupaw kha, “Vaemaw phe ka mue, tukeiccuze maeleihkuh lah, rhawtuknaw kyate yn poukhae,” a cipya. <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuin nin tuh thawte rhaw a tukkuh hae, siapharan tuh zete a chih cia, a marangle lungkhu khe ngeikuh zah Siria hae kalan khe a hawi; a vaemaw kyate a chii tuh marangle lungkhu khe alua. <verse number="36" style="v" />Khuanin he ccah tuh, “Nae khua raveih lang, nae ram raveih lang ki ccavae oh!” cite rhawkaw hae balyn kya roi accae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuhcite siapharan Ahab tuh chih zah Samaria khua lang a cciakhae hae; siapharan tuh Samaria khua kya a uu hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />A marangle kha Samaria tuili pe khe a sing hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a la hopaw bya thyhte, ui hae nynh a chii kha lya hae zah, ohhuanung hae nynh tuin kya tui a singku hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Ahab nynh rya a lawpaw te a cyipaw balyn, saepanua te a sakpaw inn te a raepaw khua hae balyn tuh Israel Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuhcite Ahab tuh a minpaaw hae ryte a ih hae; te a ccapaw Ahaziah tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jehoshafat nynh Judah A Uk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2Sh 20.31—21.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel siapharan Ahab nynh ram a uknaw kum palinaw kum khe Jehoshafat nynh Judah ram kha a uk takaw. <verse number="42" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh sung thum kum pangaw he acih te, ram kha uk takaw zah, Jerusalem khua kya kum kuin lae pangaw a uk. A nung min tuh Azubah cikuh zah Shilhi ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="43" style="v" />Aning nynh a paaw Asa laanpi miakaw kha a zui; tuh-e laanpi kyate cciasei leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ahmepaw kha a rae; tuhzemah hmin hangpaw hae kha roh khyh hae, ccungccaw hae nynh tuh-e hmin hangpaw hae kyakhe palei silaw hae zah mynkhuhpaw kha leih a u hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Jehoshafat nynh Israel siapharan te mah ccawkunaw a rae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Jehoshafat nynh rya a lawpaw, a thungnaw a langsahkupaw te rhaw a tukpaw kha Judah Siapharan hae Phungpaw Ccauh kya a zei hae. <verse number="46" style="v" />A paaw Asa she lya-e a laehy hae paw beikinn kya a ohhuakuhpaw pise hae kha ram kyate a maemih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Edom ram kya tuh siapharan um khyh; Judah siapharan nynh a khangpaw siapharan a bawmtu nynh ram kha a uk. <verse number="48" style="v" />Jehoshafat nynh Ofir ram lang cceih zah sui a phu lanpaw Tarshish sanphalung hae kha a rae hae; thuasalama cceih khyh hae; pawccecize sanphalung hae tuh Eziongeber kya aroh hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Tetuh Ahab ccapaw Ahaziah nynh Jehoshafat kha, “Ka ryalahtu hae tuh na ryalahtu hae ryte sanphalung kya cceihkheih hae sah,” a cipya, thuasalama Jehoshafat nynh ry khyh. <verse number="50" style="v" />Jehoshafat tuh a minpaaw hae ryte ih hae zah, a minpaaw David khua khe a minpaaw hae ryte a uukheih hae; a ccapaw Jehoram nynh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahaziah nynh Israel A Uk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Judah siapharan Jehoshafat nynh ram a uknaw kum haw lae sarinaw kum khe Ahab ccapaw Ahaziah nynh Israel kha Samaria khua kyate a uk takaw; aning nynh Israel kha kum ning a uk. <verse number="52" style="v" />Aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha rae zah, a paaw te a nung laanpi kha thuasah, Israel hae kha seinaw a raesah hae paw Nebat ccapaw Jeroboam laanpi kha thuasah a zui. <verse number="53" style="v" />Aning nynh Baal kha ryalawpah zah a beik; a paaw nynh a cyi hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thin a riasah.</para>
</usx>